<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samw</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu saka Samweli su Kutumbuli</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya 1Samweli na 2Samweli pu utumbuli sabia kitabu simu kikolongu sesamanyikana ngati Kitabu saka Samweli. Puutumbuli kitabu senze sabaganwa na kuba itabu ibeli yebiikemika “Litoleu la Septuagenti.” Heli labiya lihengu lukutumbuli lukuandika Lilaganu la Mwandi kuhuma mu malobi giki Ebulania kujenda ku malobi giki Kiyunani. Liina liki kitabu hesi lilangi kubanga bandu babaandika kitabu sehesi babia asomi sabini au sabini na abeli bi Kiyahudi babaandika kitabu sehesi. Mu kitabu sehsi seandiki kwi Kigiliki, kitabu ya 1Samweli na 2 Samweli biikemika 1 Akabambu Akolongu na 2 Akabambu Akolongu na mu kitabu seandiki kwa malobi gi Kilatini sebabiya aandiki baada ja hesi, itabu yeheyi biing`anambua nukuikema 1 Akabambu Akolongu na 2 Akabambu Akolongu. Ndienu itabu heyi yeimanyikana lelenu ngati 1 Akabambu Akolongu na 2 Akabambu Akolongu biikema mu litoleu heli 3 na 4. Itabu ya 1Samweli na 2Samweli ilandi Samweli ejutamika na bambu nkolongu Sauli na bambu nkolongu Daudi. Samweli jabiya ndi kilongosi ja mwisu kipindi bandu buku Izilaeli pabanga'anambuka kuhuma mu kulongoswa na baatemu, nu kutumbuli kulongoswa na akabambu akolongu. Samweli jojakaninya mahuta Sauli na Daudi kuba akabambu akolongu abeli bukutumbuli ku Izilaeli. Itabu ya 1Samweli na 2Samweli ilandi majambu ga bandu bu nndema uku Izilaeli etamika kipindi hesi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nga mundu joamanyiki jojuandiki 1Samweli na 2Samweli. Jojuandiki ngasejililogwi mweni nkati ji itabu heyi, lakini kuwesikana jabii mwomi mu kipindi soti su ulongosi waka bambu nkolongu Daudi, pangi jahigali mwomi hata baada ju ulongosi hogu, na kabee jawesa kulinga nu kusoma makalatasi gangi gagalandi kutama kwaka Sauli na Samweli. Kulengana na hali heji jejiyongolota kutambuliswa mundu au bandu baandiki itabu heyi. Kabee ngasekumanyakini itabu heyi iandikwi lile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Kusaliwa nu kukemwa kwaka nndota Samweli mu utumisi waka Sapanga. Mulipungu 1-3</para>
  <para style="io">Kilandi namuna Apilisti ebajukua Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Sapanga kuhuma kwa Aizilaeli na namuna elaleta mang'aliku Apilisti kipindi palabii mu musi wabu. Mulipungu la 4-7</para>
  <para style="io">Kilandi Aizilaeli ebapala kuba na bambu nkolongu wabu, kabee namuna Samweli eannzakaniya Sauli mahuta na namuna Sapanga eankana Sauli mwenikatai. Mulipungu la 8-15</para>
  <para style="io">Tusoma namuna Samweli eannzakaninya mahuta Daudi jubiya bambu nkolongu jwa pili juku Izilaeli na namuna Sauli ejalenga kunkoma Daudi mbaka pamwisu ukutama kwaki. Mulipungu 16-31.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elikana nu nndongu waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Jabii mundu jumu kuhuma ku Lama, juku nndema wi itombi yuku Epulaimu, jojuwe ankemika Elikana mwana waka Yelohamu, nsoko waka Eliu najombi hoju jabia mwana waka Tou jojahumila mu lukolu lwaka Sufi. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana jabia na akammbomba abeli, jumu ankemika Hana na jongi Penina. Penina jabii na bana, lakini Hana ngasejabii na bana. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Kila saka Elikana jubokika na bandu bu nyumba jaki kuhuma ku musi uku Lama nu kujenda ku musi uku Shilu. Jujendika hoku kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga nu kupia matambiku. Bana abeli baka Eli, Hofini na Finehasi babii agolu baka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Kila ekihika saka sukupia matambiku Elikana, jaapekia Penina na bana baki boti na aka kamwali baki kila jumu lipungu li inyama. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Lakini ampekia Hana mapungu gingi gi inyama ndaba ampai ngani, hata ngati Bambu Sapanga ngaseampeki bana. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Ndaba Bambu Sapanga jabiya ngaseampeki Hana bana, mmbomba nzaki jukubika jutenda kundongama. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Majambu gehaga gaendaliya kila saka. Kila Hana pajabiya jujenda mu nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, mmbomba nzaki jukubika anhengika juyoma mbaka jatenda kulela nukukana kula. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana ndomi waki mala jingi anndalukiya, “Hana, boo ndaba jakii gutenda kulela? Ndaba jakii ngasegukula? Boo, ndaba jakii gubii nu usungu mmwoju jako? Boo, nepani nga naamboni kupeta bana komi akanalome?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana nu nngolu Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Lisoba limu pababia ajomulii kula na kunywa ku Shilu, Hana jatenda kujema. Kipindi sehesi nngolu Eli jabia jutemi pikiteu puluhuka ju mpengu gu nndyangu ju Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana jabii nu usungu ngamaa. Pajabia anndoba Bambu Sapanga jabia jutenda kulela ku usungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Najombi jabeka lilaganu, kupwaaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga Mwembii na Makili Goti, ana wakalingali usungu nkolongu guku ntumisi waku nu kungomboka nepani, wala wanzewa ntumisi waku nawehapa kumpeke mwana mwanalomi, ndienu mwana we hoju nampia kwaku Bambu Sapanga kwa masoba goti gukutama kwaki, wala ngajiimogi majunzu pamutu jaki.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Pajabiya juendalee kunndoba Bambu Sapanga, Eli anndingalakiya mundomu jaki. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana jabia juloba mmwoju jaki, milomu jaki jabiya jiitenda kuhinahina lakini sauti jaki ngasejajoanike. Eli jaholaliya jutei kulobe, <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />najombi ampwagila, “Wiendaliya kulobe mbaka lile? Kotuka kulobe divai.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Hana jajibua, “Ngaela bambu wangu, nepani numbomba jojubii nu usungu nkolongu. Nepani ngasengunywiki divai wala sindu sukulobe, ila ngubika nundandi Bambu Sapanga gagabii mmwoju jango. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Wiholale nepani numbomba mbaja. Kwi kipindi soti hesi nguba nunndoba ndaba jukuhangajika kwangu na mang'aliku gangu.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Ndienu Eli anzibua, “Nnzenda su lukwali, najombi Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli jugujangatiya gagunndobiki.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana japwaaga, “Noba nuntumisi waku wiiholale liya.” Hana jaboka nukujenda kula posu na ngasejabiya kabee nu usungu.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli jutenda kusaliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Pulukela, Elikana nu nndongu waki bajumuka lukela ngani, baada jukunndumbali Bambu Sapanga, bakelubuka kunyumba jabu ku Lama. Elikana jagonila nu nhwanamundu Hana, najombi Bambu Sapanga jatenda kunkomboka. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Ndienu, Hana japata kitumbu nu kubeleka mwana mwanalomi. Hana ankema mwana we hoju Samweli, ndaba jaapwaga, “Mbatiki kuhuma kwaka Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Elikana na alongu baki boti bajenda kabee ku Shilu kumpikii Bambu Sapanga matambiku ga kila saka nukutimisa lilaganu. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hana ngasejapiti, ampwagila nndomi waki, “Mwana pajikotuka kujonga hapa ndi paniijenda, nannzukua nukumbeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, najombi jiitama hoku kipindi soti.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana nndomi waki ampwagila, “Henga leulibona laamboni ngani kwaku. Gutama pamba mbaka pawanndesa kujonga, Bambu Sapanga jugujangatiya kutimisa lilaganu laku.” Ndienu, Hana jatama panyumba nukujongesa mwanamundu mbaka paandekesa kujonga.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Paandekisa mwana kujonga, Hana anzukua mwana jola, koni jwakona nsoku ahelahe, pamu na litoli la ng'ombi la yaka itatu, kilu tisa yu uwembi nu mpuku goalenganaki kwa ngosi gwa divai, najombi andeta mwana mu nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga ku Shilu. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Ebabiya ajomwi kusinza katoli ka ng'ombi kala, bunndeta mwana kwaka nngolu Eli, <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />najombi Hana ampwagila nngolu Eli, “Wa bambu wangu, ne mbwaga sakaka bambu wangu, nepani ndi mmbomba jojabiya jujema palongi jaku nukunndoba Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Nunndoba mwana jonzo najombi Bambu Sapanga jumbeki senunndobiki. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Ndienu numpeke Bambu Sapanga mwana jonzo. Ndaba kutama kwaki kwoti kwiibiya nupiiki kwaka Bambu Sapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 1:28">Ndienu nabombi bunndumbaliya Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Hana jutenda kuloba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Ndienu Hana jaaloba nukupwaaga.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Nuntogule Bambu Sapanga mwoju jangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Nundumbalii Bambu Sapanga jojuwe makili gangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Naaheka abaja bangu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">ndaba ndogule kuwesa kwangu, ndaba Bambu Sapanga junyangati kwaawesa abaja bango!”<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Ngajojubii jwa sapi ngati Bambu Sapanga;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">ndaba ngajongi jojubii ngati jombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">ngasejubii jongi jojaakomane bandu baki ngati Sapanga witu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Nkotuka kulilumbali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">nkotuka kuba ni ing'omu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Ndaba Sapanga ndi Bambu Sapanga jojumanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Jombi ndi jwagapema mahengu gaki goti.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Mipendi ya bana makili itei kutunyuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">Lakini banga na makili aendale kupata makili.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Bababii pa mwandi abii na posu jingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">ndienu ahenga lihengu ili apata posu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Lakini bababii ni inzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">ndienu ngaseabii ni inzala kabee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mmbomba jwanga kuwesa kupapa jubeliki bana saba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Lakini mmbomba jojubii na bana bingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">ndienu anndei sanga mwana.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Bambu Sapanga jukoma nukuyoa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">jombi jahulwii pai kwa bandu baawii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">najombi jaakelabuu kabee.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Bambu Sapanga jahenga bandu bangi abia ahagu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">na bangi abii baabi na mali gingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">Bangi jutenda kwaahulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">na bangi jutenda kwaakwea.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Jaakwea ahagu kuhuma kuluombi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">jaakwea bandu babii na mang'aliku kuhuma mu maliu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">jaatamika pamu na akolongu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">nakwalisisa iteu yi isima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Ndaba misingi ju nndema ndi jaka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">jombi jujemiki misingi ju nndema.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />“Jombi ndi jagulenda womi wa bandu bahobaleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">lakini kutama kwa abaja kugasekuli kutali ku lwii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Ndaba bandu apata kuwesa kwa makili gaki.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Abaja baka Bambu Sapanga baatunula ipandi ipandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">jilunduma kupete bombi ngati kitobi kunani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Bambu Sapanga jagutemula nndema woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">ampekiya makili bambu nkolongu waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">jagukoa uwesu gwaka mundu joahagwi.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Ndipala Elikana jajenda kunyumba jaki ku Lama, lakini mwana Samweli jahigali ku Shilu, antumakiya Bambu Sapanga pai juku nngolu Eli.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana baka nngolu Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Ndienu, bana akanalomi baka Eli babiya bandu biliya, ngasebunnzogipi Bambu Sapanga, <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />wala kupete hindu yeyuye bandu bapalika kwaapeke akaagolu. Kila kipindi mundu pajabia ampiki matambiku gaki, kiipindi inyama jakona jakabela mtumisi juku nngolu jahika ni kijiku sekibii na minu matatu. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Ntumisi jahomika kijiku hesi nkati ji kibega ni inyama jokapi jeapiiki homu ku kijiku hesi, jiikubika juku nngolu. Hela ndi ebahenga Aizilaeli boti babajenda ku Shilu kupia matambiku gabu. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Lakini hata kabula ja mahuta gikinyama haga ngaseajosiki, ntumisi juku nngolu jahika nukumpwaagi mundu jojupiiki matambiku, “Mpikia nngolu inyama jukujosa, ndaba ngajiijopi inyama jeateliki kuhuma kwaku ila jejibii mbei pena.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Ana mundu ampwagi, “Leka oti mahuta gi inyama ajosa goti, ndienu wiijukua sokapi segupala,” hapa ndi ntumisi waka nngolu jijibua, “Mbekiya henu, anangasegupai niijukua kwa makili.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Mahakau ganga ga akakombu baka Eli gabiya makolongu ngamaa pamihu jaka Bambu Sapanga, kwa ndaba babia alongama matambiku gaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli ku Shilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Lakini Samweli jaendaliya kuntumaki Bambu Sapanga, koni juwati kizibau kihuu. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Kila saka anyongo ansonila ingobu nzoku, nukumpelakee pajabia jujenda nu nndomi waki kumpiki Bambu Sapanga matambiku ga kila saka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Nngolu Eli jaapengila Elikana nu nhwanamundu kila pababiya ajenda kupiya matambiku, kupwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jugupekiya bana kuku mbomba ajo ili kujukuu napwasi jaka jola jojabiya anndoba nu kumpia kwaka Bambu Sapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:20">Ndipala babia ajenda kunyumba.<verse eid="1SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Najombi Bambu Sapanga ammbonila ikia Hana, najombi japata bana atatu na akakamwali abeli. Kipindi sehesi, nkombu Samweli jaendaliya kukola nukutumika palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli na bana baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Kipindi se hesi Eli jabiya nseja ngamaa. Pajajoa goa gabaahengiki bana baki kwa bandu Izilaeli, namuna ebabiya agone na akammbomba bababiya atumaki pi litanga li lihema lukuketangane, <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Eli jaalalukiya, “Boo, ndaba jaki nhenga majambu haga? Ndaba nyoini kuhuma kwa bandu boti kihakau senhenga. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Mwiihenga hela mwabana bangu ndaba majambu haga goti ganyoini kuhuma kwa bandu baka Bambu Sapanga ndi gi kihakau.” <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Mundu ana ankosi nnzaki, guwesa kunndobe kwaka Bambu Sapanga ili Sapanga andekakiya. Lakini mundu ana ankosi Bambu Sapanga, ndi nya joantemulaje?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:25">Lakini bana haba ngasebajoani atati babu, ndaba Bambu Sapanga japangi kwaakoma.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Mwana Samweli jaendaliya kukola, Bambu Sapanga na bandu bajonzukiya kumpala.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobi gaka Sapanga kwaka Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Lisoba limu, mundu jumu jwaka Sapanga annzendila Eli nukumpwagi, “Bambu Sapanga jupwaaga ana, ‘Boo, ngasenilimanyisa pangwendu kwi ibeleku yaka Aloni na aseja baku, pababii atumwa baka Falau ku nndema uku Misili?’ <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Kati ja makabila goa guku Izilaeli nunhagula Aloni ni ibeleku yaki kuba agolu bangu, andumakiya pandu pukupiiki litambiku, ili apogaliya ubani nu kuwata izibau palongi jangu. Naapekiya alongu ba atati baku matambiku gangu gaguge Aizilaeli bambikia kwa mwotu. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Ndaba jakii ugaboni wipu na matambiku gangu nepani na matambiku gala ganalagalakiya ili anetilaje? Boo ndaba jakii watende isima bana baku kupeta nepane, sukulinenepesa beni kwa kula pandu papabii sapi ngani ya kila matambiku gaapia bandu bangu buku Izilaeli? <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli apwaaga, ‘Sakaka naapwaga bandu bumu nyumba jaku na bandu bunyumba ja atati baku biindumakiya nepani yaka yoti,’ lakini henu Bambu Sapanga jupwaaga, ‘Lijambu heli ndi libiya kutali nanepani,’ ndaba bombi baandende isima nanepani niitenda kwatendee isima, na bombi baatenda kunongama nanepani niitenda kwaalongama. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Joaninya, masoba gahika papuje niikoma akakombu boti akanalomi mu ulongu waku na mu lukolu lwaku, kabee ngakwiikubi na mwanalomi jokapi jojiibiya jutama homu mbaka nseja. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Nanagu wikuba ni kiholu munyumba jaku na waabonila ajaku wipu, kwa mali gingi gabiipata bandu bangi buku Izilaeli, lakini nga mundu kunyumba jaku ngakwiikubi nu nseja yaka yoti. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Jumu kati ji ibeleku inu jiitenda kuhigali ili jundumakiya ngati nngolu, lakini naanhenga jubiya jwanga kulinga ni jibiya jojubii nu usungu ni ibeleku inu ikuwa kwa mang'aliku. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Sakaka nginyuli jenze jiilangia gambwagiki haga ga sakaka kubanga bana baku abeli akanalomi, Hofini na Finehasi ndi lende. Boti abeli biikuwa lisoba limu. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Ndienu, nanhagula nngolu jongi jojuhobaleka na jojihenga kila sindu sembala juhenga. Nansengila lukolu lolubii nganganganga, najombi jitumakiya palongi jaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Jokapi jojihigaliya mu ulongu waku anzendila nngolu hoju nu kunndoba kipandi sa madini ga feza au mabumunda nukumpwagi, ‘Meka mu lihengu la kwaajangati agolu ili nhwesa kupata sindu sa kula.’”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Bambu Sapanga ampiti Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Kipindi sehesi, nkombu Samweli pajabiya antumaki Bambu Sapanga pai ju ulonda waka Eli, malobi kuhuma kwaka Bambu Sapanga ngasegabile, na Bambu Sapanga jukubika ngasejulangi hindu kuhuma kwaki. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Lisoba limu ikilu, Eli jojuwe miu gaki gakubika ngasegalinga sapi, jabiya jugoni musumba saki. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Samweli najombi jabiya jugoni nkati ja nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga pambipi ni Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Sapanga. Taa jaka Bambu Sapanga jabiya jakoni jakanyaka ndaba kwabiya kwakoni ngasekukusiki. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ankema Samweli! Najombi Samweli, jajetika, “Mii pambane!” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Samweli anzendila Eli nnyata, ampwagila, “Nhikiki ndaba gutei kungema.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Lakini Eli ampwagila, “Nepani ngasenunkemike. Jenda ukagonila.” Samweli jakelubuka nu kugone.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Bambu Sapanga ankema kabee, “Samweli!” Samweli jajumuka, nukunzende Eli nukumpwagi, “Nhikiki ndaba gutei kungema.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Lakini Eli ampwagila, “Ngasenugukemiki wamwana wangu kagonila kabee.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samweli jabiya ngakummanya Bambu Sapanga jakona, wala Bambu Sapanga jabiya ngasejuwaiki kulonge na najombi.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Bambu Sapanga ankema Samweli kwa mala ja tatu. Samweli jajumuka nukunzendee Eli nu kumpwagi, “Nhikiki ndaba gutei kungema.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Ndienu Eli pajamanya kuba Bambu Sapanga ndi joankema Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ndienu Eli ampwagila Samweli, “Jenda ukagonila na anajugukemiki kabee gumpwagila ana, ‘Pwaga, mwaa Bambu Sapanga, nepani ntumisi waku ndenda kugujoane.’ ” Ndienu Samweli jakelubuka nu kugone pandu paki.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Mwenikatai, Bambu Sapanga jahika kujema papuje, ankema Samweli ngati puuwanzu, “Samweli! Samweli!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Samweli jatenda kujeteka, “Pwaga Bambu, ndaba nepani nu ntumisi ndenda kugujoane.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Samweli, “Linga niihenga lihengu mu Izilaeli lelule naanhenga bandu ajowana nukusituka. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Kipindi sehesi niihenga goti ganapwaaga naanhengila Eli na aalongu baki, kutumbuli pu uwanzu mbaka pa mwisu. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Ndaba numpwagila ana naatemula alongu baki yaka yoti kwa ndaba mahakau gabu jagamanyiki, bana baki akanalomi andondwi nepani Bambu Sapanga najombi ngasejaakaniki. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ndienu naapa kubanga kilongu saka Eli mahakau gabu ngagiiboki hata kulenga, ku litambiku au lukutinii au matambiku ga nhupi.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samweli jagonila mbaka pulukela, ndipala jajumuka nukupunguu matanga ga nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga. Lakini Samweli jajogupa kumpwagi Eli gajagabweni. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Hata hela Eli ankema Samweli nukumpwagi, “Samweli wamwanangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samweli jajetika, “Eee!”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli anndalukiya, “Boo Bambu Sapanga jugupwagi kike? Wihiya sejugupwagi. Ana gunhihiki sejugupwagili, Sapanga jitenda kugulapu.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ndienu, Samweli anndandila Eli goti gaampwagila, sanga kuhia sokapi. Ndienu Eli japwaaga, “Jombi ndi Bambu Sapanga nujuhenga sejubona saamboni kwaki.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samweli jaendaliya kukola na Bambu Sapanga jabiya pamu najombi, na gala goti gajapwaaga Samweli nga hata limu langa kutimi. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Nabombi Aizilaeli boti kutumbulii ku musi uku Dani upandi uku kasikazini mbaka ku Beeli Sheba upandi uku Kusini bamanya Samweli ndi nndota jojuhobaleka waka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Najombi Bambu Sapanga jaendaliya kulilangi ku Shilu kokuje ampitila Samweli nu kulonge naku. Najombi Samweli pajapwaaga sindu, Aizilaeli boti batenda kunzoane.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Afilisti ajukuu kwa makili Lisanduku li Lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Kipindi se hesi Apilisiti baketangana pamu ili bakakomana na Aizilaeli. Aizilaeli babeka likambi labu ku Ebenezeli na Apilisti babeka likambi labu ku Afeka. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Alonda ba Apilisti baaalapula Aizilaeli na ebabiya atenda kukomana, Aizilaeli batenda kusindwa na bandu elupu nsesi batenda kukomeka mu lubanza lwa ngondu. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Kipindi pababiya akelabuka mu likambi, aseja buku Izilaeli balaluana, “Ndaba jakii Bambu Sapanga jwaalei Apilisti atuwesa leleno? Tuleta Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga kuhuma ku Shilu ili awesa kujenda pamu na twepani nu kutuokoa kuhuma kwa abaja bitu.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Ndienu baatuma bandu kujenda ku Shilu, nabombi bajukua Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga Jwana Makili goti, jojutama pi kiteu saki sa mwandi kati ji iumbi yeibii na mapapati. Nabombi bana abeli bala baka Eli Hofini na Finehasi bababii pamu ni Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Kipindi Lisanduku li Lilaganu palahika ku likambi, Aizilaeli boti bapega keleli kwa sauti ngolongu hata luombi lwatenda kubagaja. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Apilisti pabajoa kujamalii kwabu baalalukiya, “Boo, keleli haye yoti mu likambi la Aebulania ibii na mana bole?” Pabamanya kubanga Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga labiya lihikiki mu likambi la Aizilaeli, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Apilisti batenda kujogopa bapwaaga, “Isapanga ijingii mu likambi labu. Mwisitukiboni! Ndaba ngaseliwaiki kupitii lijambu ngati hale. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Mwisitukiboni! Nya jojiwesa kutuoko kuhuma mu maboku mwi isapanga yana makile? Heyi ndi isapanga yeyaakoma Amisili kwa kila aina na kukomana ku lukoba. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Ndienu Apilisti muligangamalisa mwoju. Mmbia mommbii nganganganga ili mwiikuba mwaatumwa ba Aebulania ngati ebabii atumwa bitu. Mmbia nganganganga ngati akanalomi nu kukomana.”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Ndienu Apilisti batenda kukomana naku sanalomi, Aizilaeli basidwa na kila mundu jakelubuka kunyumba jaki. Lisoba leheli bandu bingi batenda kukomeka, Aizilaeli bababiya ajenda kwa magolu bahiki elupu selasini batenda kuwa. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Lisanduku li Lilaganu batenda kujukuu kwa makili na Apilisti na bana abeli baka Eli babube ndi Hofini na Finehasi batenda kukomeka.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Lisoba alelalela mndonda jumu jukuhuma likabila laka Benjamini jabutuka kuhuma ku nstali wa palongi nukukomana mbaka ku Shilo koni ingobu yaki ijendukini koni jubii nu luombi mu umutu. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Eli jabiya ni kiholu ndaba ji Lisanduku li Lilaganu, jabiya jutemi pi kiteu saki, mulutengu ji indela koni julingalii. Mundu jola pajahika ku musi nukulandi majambu haga, bandu ba misi joa balela kwa sauti ngolongu. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli pajajoa kwa sauti ji kilelo, jalalukiya, “Keleli haye ndi ya kike?” Nndonda jola jajenda nnyata kwaka Eli ili kumpwagi majambu ge haga. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Kipindi sehesi, Eli jabiya na yaka tisini na nani na miu gaki gabiya gansegalinga kabee. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Mundu jola ampwagila Eli, “Nepani nhuma kukukomana sajenu, ndiliki kuhuma kukukomana lelenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eli anndalukiya, “Mwana wangu majambu ge hoku gabi bole?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Nndonda jojabiya juletiki majambu jola japwaaga, “Aizilaeli baatiliki Apilisti. Kabee bandu bingi baakomiki ngamaa kati ja Aizilaeli. Na bana baku boti abeli Hofini na Fineasi baakomiki, na Apilisti ajukwii Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Sapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Mundu hoju pajalogula pee Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Sapanga, Eli jahabuka pai kuhuma pikiteu saki pulutengu ju ndyangu, Eli pajabiya juhabwiki hela hingu jaki jabiya jitunwiki ndaba jabiya nseja ngamaa na jabiya nneni, najombi jatenda kuwa. Eli jabiya mundu jojutemu ku Izilaeli kwa yaka alubaini.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka mmbomba jwaka Finehasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Kabee kwapitila ana, nkowani waka Eli yani nhwanu waka Finehasi, kipindi sehesi jabiya jubii ni kitumbu, na masoba gaki gu kujipungua gabiya gaegalii. Pajajoa ana Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Sapanga atei kulijuku na akowanu baki, hata nu nndomi waki jutei kuwa, masoba gaki gukupapa gabiya gahegali pajajoa haga jatenda kupapa lakini jabiya nu usungu nkolongu. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Ndienu, pajabia jutenda kuwa, akammbomba bababia atenda kunzangatii bumpwagila, “Wijogopa ndaba gujipungwi mwana mwanalomi.” Lakini jombi ngasejajibua lilobi, wala ngasejajoaninya. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Najombi ankema mwana waki Ikabodi mana jaki, “Ulumbii waka Sapanga atei kuguboa ku Izilaeli,” jabiya na mana ji Lisanduku li Lilaganu labiya alinyagiki, kabee akowanu baki nu nndomi waki boti akuwaiki. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Japwaaga, “Ulumbi waka Sapanga guboi ku Izilaeli ndaba Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga atei kulijuku.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku li Lilaganu kwa Apilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Apilisti ebabiya ajukwi kwa makili Lisanduku li Lilaganu, batotula kuhuma musi uku Ebenezeli mbaka musi wabu uku Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Ndienu bilipelika Lisanduku li Lilaganu kwaka Bambu Sapanga mu nyumba ji kisapanga wabu Dagoni nukulibeka pambipi nasu. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Kilabu jaki pulukela, bandu ba musi uku Ashidodi pabajumuka bikibona kimong'umong'u saka Dagoni kihabwiki lutumbu pai palongi ji Lisanduku laka Sapanga. Bikijemika kabee kimong'umong'u sa Dagoni nukukibeka kabee pandu jaki. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Lakini kilabu jaki pulukela pabajumuka, bikibona kabee kimong'umong'u sa Dagoni kihabwiki kabee kimutu pai palongi ji Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga, kimutu na magolu na maboku giki kimong'umong'u se hesi yoti yabia itunukini, sabiya kigoni pai pu luhuka ju nndyangu. Lahigali lipesi likimong'umong'u sa Dagoni pena. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Kwa ndaba heji agolu baka Dagoni na boti baajingi kunndumbali Dagoni ku Ashidodi, paajingi mu nyumba jaka Dagoni ngaseakanyati felemu ja nyumba jaka Dagoni mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Bambu Sapanga jaalapula ngamaa na kwaajogoo bandu buku Ashidodi. Jaalapula mbaka bandu bapambipi jabu, sa kwaalete ugonzu wa maputi. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Ndienu bandu buku Ashidodi, pabagabona majambu gagapatiki, bapwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli jutulapu ngani twepani ni kisapanga witu Dagoni. Ndienu Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga ngaliwesi kutama kwitu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ndienu, baatuma bandu na kwaakusanya akolongu boti buku Pilisti na kwaalalukii, “Boo twiihenga kike ni Lisanduku laka Sapanga wa Aizilaele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Akolongu babu bajibua, “Lisanduku laka Sapanga juku Izilaeli heli mpelika ku Gati.” Ndienu bilipelika ku musi uku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Lakini ebabia alipeliki ku Gati, Bambu Sapanga jugulapula musi we hogu, jwaleta lujogopu lukolongu ku musi, najaapula akanalomi ba musi we hogu, akakombu na aseja sakwaalete maputi. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ndienu, bilipelika Lisanduku laka Sapanga heli ku musi uku Ekiloni. Lakini Lisanduku laka Sapanga heli palahika hoku, bandu ba musi we hogu bapega keleli, “Butuleti Lisanduku lende laka Sapanga wa Aizilaeli ili kutukoma twepani na bandu bitu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Ndienu baatuma bandu na kwaakusanya akolongu buku Apilisti na kwaapwagi, “Nkelubua Lisanduku laka Sapanga wa Aizilaeli komwijukua, ili latukoma twepani pamu na bandu bitu.” Bahenga hela ndaba kwabii nu lujogopu lukolongu mu musi gwoa ndaba Sapanga jabiya jaalapu ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Bandu bingi batenda kuwa, na babahigali gaapata maputi mbaka kilelu sabu sahika kwi isapanga yabu ili yaajangatiya.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Apilisti akelabu Lisanduku li Lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Kipindi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga palabiya kwa Apilisti kwa miei saba, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Apilisti baakema agolu baka Dagoni na baalondo na kwaapwagi, “Tuhenga kyane ni Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga? Mutupwagila namuna jikilikelabuu pandu jaki.”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Bajibua, “Ana nkelabuu Lisanduku laka Sapanga wa Aizilaeli, mwalikelabuu maboku matopu. Lakini kwa namuna jokapi pamwalikelubua mpelika na matambiku gukuboa kihakau. Ana nhengiki hela mwiitenda kulama, nanamu mwiimanya ndaba jakii juunndapu mala joti heji.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Bandu balalukiya, “Tupelakia matambiku bo gukutuboke kihakao?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Bombi bajibua, “Imong'umong'u nhwanu ya zahabu yeilengana na maputi, ni imong'umong'u nhwanu ya zahabu yeilengana na makuli, kila simu kilangia nkolongu jumu jwa Apilisti, ndaba ugonzu wa tauni gobatuma kwinu ndi agolago gowapata akakilongosi binu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Kupalika nndenganakiya imong'umong'u ya maputi na makuli ginu, hindu yeihalabana kila sindu mu nndema winu. Kupalika mumpekia isima Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli. Pangi jiikotuka kunndapu mwabeti ni isapanga inu nu nndema winu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Ndaba jakii mujihenga mioju jii kuba jejinonwipi ngati bandu buku Misili na Falau ebahengaje? Boo, Sapanga pajaalapula ngamaa Amisili, ngasejaaleka Aizilaeli aboka, nabombi batenda kuboka? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Ndienu, mmbeka ligali linyai lukuhutwa na ng'ombi ibeli yeyuye yeibeliki lakini yanga kuwai hata kulenga kwiikonga nngoji nukuihengesa mahengu, mwaikonga mu ligali heli, lakini matoli gabu giijenda naku pamu, ila ihigali mu kisisi. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Nnzukua Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga nu kulibeka muligali heli. Pulutengu ji Lisanduku mmbeka imong'umong'u ya zahabu yeyuye mupelakee ngati matambiku gukuboa kihau sinu. Ndienu mulileka lijenda kolijenda. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Ndienu nndingaliya, ana kubii ligali heli lijenda jumula ku nndema waki yani mu musi uku Beti Shemasi, ndienu hapa patwiimanya ana jojutuleti ugonzu gongo ndi Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli. Lakini ana ngaselijenda hoku, ndienu, twiimanya nga kuboku kwake kokutulapwii, ila mang'aliku haga gutupatiki kwa bahati mbaja.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Bahenga ngati ebaapwagila, baajukua ng'ombi ibeli yebiiminya masiba nu kwiikonga muligali, na matoli gabu bagakonga mu kisisi. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Lisanduku li Lilaganu bilijegala mu ligali heli pamu ni libokusi lelibii ni imong'umong'u ya zahabu ya makuli na maputi. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ng'ombi yeheyi yajenda ku musi uku Beti Shemesi sanga kugoboka ku mangega au ku malele, na yabia itenda kupongale koni ijendanane. Akabambu akolongu bala ba Apilisti baapwata mbaka ku mpaka wa Beti Shemesi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Kipindi sehesi bandu buku Beti Shemesi babiya ahuna inganu yabu kumosu, pabalinga kusana bilibona Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga, batogulii ngamaa pabilibona, <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Ligali lelela lajenda mu litui laka Joshua, mundu juku Beti Shemesi. Palahika hapa bilijemika pambipi ni lilibu likolongu. Bandu batenda kubombo ligali le ela, batumia imbau yabu sukutini ng'ombi yela yebabia biipihiki ngati matambiku gukutinii kwaka Bambu Sapanga wabu. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Alawi babia alihulwi Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga ni libokusi lelabii ni imong'umong'u ya zahabu nu kubeka pi lilibu likolongu lela. Ndienu lisoba heli bandu buku Beti Shemasi bapia matambiku gingi gukutini, nukumpiki Bambu Sapanga matambiku gangi. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Akabambu akolongu nhwanu ba Apilisti bala pabagabona haga, babuja ku Ekiloni lisoba alelale.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Apilisti bapelika imong'umong'u nhwanu ya zahabu na ya maputi kwaka Bambu Sapanga hei yabiya matambiku gukuboa kihakau sabu, bapia kimong'umong'u simu kwa ndaba ja kila musi gumu, musi uku Ashidodi na musi uku Gaza na musi uku Ashikiloni na musi uku Gati na musi uku Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Bapelika kabee ni imong'umong'u nhwanu ya zahabu na ya makuli kulengana na hesabu ja misi joti ja Apilisti jealongosa na akabambu akolongu nhwanu buku Filisti. Misi joti jejabiii na ngomi ni ijiji yeyuye ngasebayongulakii lumatu. Lilibu likolongu lelibii mu litui likolongu laka Joshua ku Beti Shemasi, pandu papuje bapelika Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga, ndi lilangi kukomboka namuna majambu haga eagaptila.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga jaakoma akanalomi sabini ba musi uku Beti Shemasi, ndaba balingaliya nkati ji Lisanduku laki. Bandu balobalakiya ndaba jaka Bambu Sapanga jaakomiki bandu bingi nakanopi.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku li Lilaganu ku Kiliati Yealimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Ndienu bandu ba musi uku Beti Shemasi bapwaaga, “Boo, nya jojuwesa kujema palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jojubii jwa Sape? Boo, lisanduku liijenda kwaka nya ili juboka kwito?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ndipala, baatuma atenga kujenda kwa bandu ba musi uku Kiliati Yealimu, apwaaga, “Apilisti akelabwii Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, nhika nzukua.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Ndienu, bandu buku Kiliati Yealimu bahika kujukuu Lisanduku laka Sapanga. Bilipelika nkati ja nyumba jaka Abinadabu jojabiya jutama kukitombi nukummbeka Eleazali mwana waki kulitunza Lisanduku heli.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli julongosa nndema uku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Sapeta kipindi kilasu sa yaka ishilini tumbuka Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga palapelikwa ku musi uku Kiliati Yealimu. Kipindi sehesi Aizilaeli boti bunndelila Bambu Sapanga ili jwaajangatiya.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Ndienu, Samweli jaapwagila Aizilaeli, “Ana munkelubuki Bambu Sapanga kwa mioju jinu joti, kupalika mmboa kati jinu isapanga ikigeni ni imong'umong'u yuku Ashitaloti. Munkelubukiya Bambu Sapanga kwa mwoju winu, nukunndumbali jombi kajika jaki, najombi janhokua kuhuma mu maboku ga Apilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Ndienu, Aizilaeli balekala kutali imong'umong'u ya Mabaali na Maashitaloti, bunndumbaliya Bambu Sapanga kajika jaki.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Ndienu, Samweli jaakema Aizilaeli boti aketangana ku Mizipa, jaapwagila, “Hoku naanndoba Bambu Sapanga ndaba jinu.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ndienu, Aizilaeli boti bakusanyika ku Mizipa. Bateka masi nukujakana palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ngati litambiku, ni lisoba heli bakotuka kula posu lisoba loti nu kupwaaga, “Tuhengiki mahakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga.” Samweli jatumbuliya kwaalongosa Aizilaeli kuzipa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Apilisti ebabajoa Aizilaeli akusanyiki ku Mizipa, akabambu akolongu nhwanu na Apilisti bajenda kwaashambuli. Aizilaeli pabajoa lijambu leheli, baajogipi ngamaa Apilisti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Bandu buku Izilaeli bumpwagila Samweli, “Wikotoka kunndele Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, ili jutuokua kuhuma kwa Apilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Ndienu, Samweli jajukua likondoo libana ampikia Bambu Sapanga ngati matambiku gukutini. Pajajomula anndoba Bambu Sapanga ndaba ja Aizilaeli, najombi Bambu Sapanga jajibua kuloba kwaki. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Samweli pajabia jupia litambiku lukutini, Apilisti bahegaliya ili kukomana na Aizilaeli. Lakini Bambu Sapanga japia sauti ngolongu kwa Apilisti, na kwaahenga abiya ni kiholu, nabombi batila palongi ja Azilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Aizilaeli baboka ku Mizipa na kwaapwatali Apilisti mbaka pambipi na musi uku Beti Kali, batenda kwaakoma mwiindela homu.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Ndienu, Samweli jajukua lilibu nu kulijemeka kati ja Mizipa na Sheni, jilikema lilibu heli Ebenezali kupwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jutujangati mbaka sajenu.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Lisoba heli Apilisti batenda kusindwa, na Bambu Sapanga jaapengaliya Apilisti kugulapu nndema guku Izilaeli kipindi soti Samweli pajabii mwomi. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Misi joti juku Izilaeli jejuje Apilisti babia anyagiki kati juku Ekiloni nuku Gati bakelubua kwa Aizilaeli, nabombi Aizilaeli bakombula nndema wabu kuhuma kwa Apilisti. Kabee kwabia nu lukwali kati na Aizilaeli na Aamoli.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samweli jabia kilongosi jwa Aizilaeli mu womi waki woti. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Kila saka Samweli jatembaliya ku Beteli, nuku Giligali nuku Mizipa nu kwaamuu Aizilaeli mu misi heji joa. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Na pajabiya jukelabuka ku Lama ndi kojabii nyumba jaki, na hoku ndi jaatemula Aizilaeli. Najombi hoku ndi ansengila Bambu Sapanga pandu pukupiki matambiku.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli aloba abiya na bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Ndienu, Samweli pajabiya nseja, jaahenga bana baki akanalomi abiya aka kilongosi buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwana waki ju utumbulii ankema Joeli na jwa pili ankema Abiya. Boti abeli babiya aka kilongosi ku Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Lakini bana haba ngasebapwata tabia ja atati babu. Ila batumbuliya kulupala lupija ngamaa. Ngasebaatemwi bandu ngati ekupalika.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ndienu, akakilongosi boa buku Izilaeli bakusanyika pamu, nukunzendee Samweli ku musi uku Lama, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />bumpwagila, “Linga wehapa henu ndi nseja na bana baku ngaseapwata tabia jaku. Ndienu utuhaguliya bambu nkolongu jukulongosa ngati ejibii milema jengi.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Lakini lijambu la Aizilaeli kupala ubambu ukolongu ukulongosa, ngaselunndengani Samweli. Najombi anndoba Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Joannya kila sindu sebugupwagi bandu, ndaba ngasebugukaniki wehapa, ila anganiki nepani kuba bambu nkolongu wabu. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Tumbuka panaapia ku Misili, anei nepani, nukutumaki isapanga yengi mbaka lelenu. Hela ndi ebuguhenge na wehapa. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Ndienu, waajonnya lakini waalakaliya ngani, na waalandila namuna bambu nkolongu jojaalongusa ndi ejaahengila.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Ndienu, Samweli jaapwaagila bandu bala bababia aloba baapekiya bambu nkolongu malobi goti gaka Bambu Sapanga gaampwagila. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Samweli jaapwagila, “Hela ndi bambu nkolongu winu ndi ejanhengila. Bana binu akanalomi jaahenga abiya baendesa magali gaki gukuhtwa na falasi, na bangi kuba baakwela falasi na bangi bibutuka palongi ja magali ga alonda. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Jihagula bangi abiya akolongu ba makundi gaki ga alonda akolongu na bangi abiya akolongu ba makundi ga bandu hamusinihamusini. Bangi jaahenga andemila matui gaki nu kuhusa ilebi yaki. Jaahenga kabee bangi andenganakiya hindu yukukomane, na bangi alenganakiya hindu yukulenganake magali gaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Akakamwali binu baajukua kuba baalenganake mahuta gaganungi sapi gaka bambu nkolongu, bangi kuteleka na bangi kujosa mabumunda. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Jiijukua matui ginu gagabii sapi, na matui ginu gi mizeituni, na matui gi mizabibu na kwaapeke atumisi baki. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Najombi jiijukua pandu pa komi pi ilebi inu na kwaabagi na atumisi baahenga lihengu mu nyumba ji kibambu ukolongu. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Jaajukua atumisi bii akanalomi na akambomba na ngombi inu ya sapi, na maponda ginu ga sapi ngani, nakwaahenga bunhengila mahengu gaki. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Jijukua pandu pa komi pa makondoo ginu. Mwanganya mwabeti mwiibiya mwaatumwa baki. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Kipindi sehesi, mwanganaya mwiilalamika ku usungu ndaba bambu nkolongu winu jojuwe mwilihagulii mwanganya mwabeti. Lakini Bambu Sapanga ngajannzoane.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Hata hela bandu bakana kunzoane Samweli, kukupwaaga, “Twepani tupala kuba bambu nkolongu witu, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />ili na twepani tubiya ngati bandu bi milema jengi. Bambu nkolongu witu jiitenda kututemula nukutulongosa nukutukomane mu ngondu jitu.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samweli jajoaninya kila sindu bandu sebapwaaga, ndienu jajenda kunndandi Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Samweli, “Wajoanakiya ngati eapala na waapekiya bambu nkolongu.” Ndienu Samweli jaapwagila bandu buku Izilaeli, kila mundu jujenda kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Samweli juketangana na Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Ndienu, mu likabila laka Benjamini kwabii na mundu jumu jojubii na mali gingi na jojumanyakini ngamaa joankema Kishi. Jombi jabia mwana waka Abieli, msokoo waka Zelo ji kibeleku saka Bekolati ju lukolu lwaka Afia. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kishi jabiya na mwana mwanalomi joankema Sauli. Sauli jabia nkombu jojunyambiki ngamaa, na ngasejabii mundu mu Izilaeli jojalengana na Sauli sukunyamba. Sauli jabiya nndasu ngani kupeta mundu jokapi mu nndema uku Izilaeli, bandu boti bunhikila mu mabega.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Lisoba limu, maponda gaka Kishi atati baka Sauli, gatei kuhoba. Kishi ampwagila Sauli, “Munzukua ntumisi jumu, gujenda kugataputa maponda.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Ndienu japeta mu nndema uku Efulaimu uku itombi ni lieneu luku Shalisha, lakini ngasebagabweni kokuje. Ndienu bahika ku Shalimu na hoku ngasebagabweni. Baataputa mu nndema uku Benjamini hata hela ngasebagapataje. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Pabahika mu nndema uku Sufu, Sauli ampwagila ntumisi waki, “Tubuja ku nyumba ana ngaela atati bangu biikotuka kuholale maponda, na henu bibiya butuholale twepani.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Ntumisi jola ampwagila, “Lenda oti kasokopi mu musi gongo jubii mundu waka Sapanga jojuwe antende isima ngamaa, kila seapwaaga kikuba sa sakaka. Ndienu tunzendila, pangi juwesa kutupwagi tujenda indela boo kogabii maponda.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli anndalukiya, “Lakini anantunzendii twampekiya kyane? Linga posu mu mipuku jitu jijomwiki na ngasetubii na sokapi sukumpeke mundu waka Sapanga. Boo, tubii na kike?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Ntumisi anzibua Sauli, “Linga nepani mina lingengalema limu lisoku la madini ga shaba. Naampekiya mundu waka Sapanga hoju ili jutupwagila majambu kupete sapwali jitu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Puutumbuli bandu buku Izilaeli ana ngati apala kunndoba Sapanga sindu, bapwaaga, “Henu guhika tujenda kwaka mundu jojubona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:9">Ndaba mundu joankema nndota masoba ga mwandi akemika jojubona. <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli anzibua, “Heli ndi lijambu laamboni, tuboka.” Ndienu bajenda ku musi mojabia jutama ntumisi waka Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Pababia akwela kitombi kujenda ku musi, baketangana na akakamwali babia ajenda kuteka masi mu kiliba. Baalalukiya akakamwali haba, “Boo, jojubona jubii ku muse?”<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Akambomba bala bajibua, “Hena jubii kabee palongi jino, ana nhengiki nnyata mbaka munketane. Jujingii pelelenu pa musi, ndaba lelenu bandu ajenda kukupia matambiku. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Apalapa pamwiijingila pe kumusi, mwankolila kabula ngasejupiti pandu pukunndumbali ku kitombi ili kula. Ndienu jiikula posu pamu na bandu baabii hapa. Mwenikatai babakokiki bala biikula posu. Ndienu nzenndannya nnyata, mwakaketangana naku sajenu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ndienu Sauli nu ntumisi waki bajenda ku musi. Pababia ajingi ku mumusi, bummbona Samweli juhuma ku musi, nu juhika koabii kon jujenda pandu pukulumbali.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jabiya ampwagi Samweli, lisoba limu kabula Sauli jukunnzende ampwagila, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Kilabu muda ngati gongo nagupelakiya mundu kuhuma likabila la Benjamini, nawehapa gunzakani mahuta ili jubia bambu nkolongu panani ja bandu bangu buku Izilaeli. Jombi jaokoa bandu bangu kuhuma mu mang'aliku ga Apilisti na bandu bangu aneli ili naajangati nanepani nyoini kilelu sabu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Hata Samweli paammbona Sauli, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Hoju ndi mundu jola jonugupwagila majambu gaki, kupwaaga jombi ndi jaalongusa bandu bangu buku Izilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Sauli anhegaliya Samweli mundyangu nu kunndaluki, “Gupepa koku, gunangia panyumba jaka mundu jojagabona na kwaapwagi bandu majambu gabu?”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samweli anzibua, “Nepani ndi nenibona. Nndonguliya kujenda pandu pukulumbali, ndaba lelenu ngiti nkula pamu na nepani. Kilabu pulukela majambu goti gagubii nagu ngiti ndenda kugujibu nukuguleka wiijenda. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Majambu ga maponda gagahobiki masoba matatu gagapetiki, mwiihola ndaba gapatakini. Lakini nya jobumpala ngani bandu buku Izilaeli? Boo nga wehapa na bandu nyumba ja atati bako?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli jajibua, “Nepani ndi ju likabila laka Benjamini, likabila lisoku kupeta makabila goti guku Izilaeli. Na mu likabila loti la Abenjamini alongu bangu nepani ndi abii asoku ngani. Lakini ndaba jakii gunongale hela?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Ndienu, Samweli ampelika Sauli nu ntumisi waki pasengu, pandu piisima ngani. Kobatemi ageni babaakokiki kwabii na ageni ngati selasini elahe. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samweli ampwagila mundu jojuteleka jola, “Leta kipandi si inyama senugupekiya senugupwagila gukibeka pulutengu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Jojuteleka jola jajenda nu kuleta inyama ju nhunguu nukuibeka palongi jaka Sauli. Ndienu Samweli ampwagila Sauli, “Linga seagubeki, ndienu abei palongi jaku. Henu gukula ndaba abei kwa ndaba jaku ili guwesa kula pamu na ageni.” <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Pabakelubuka mu musi kuhuma pandu pukunndumbali, Samweli anntandakia kitanda Sauli panani ji nhwaga sa nyumba, balongalania nukugone hoku.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli ampaki mahuta Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Bajumuka pulukela ngani, Samweli ankema Sauli kuhuma ku nhaga. “Jumuka ili nugunhindakiya kubuja kunyumba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyumba ya Aizilaeli akubika ngiti ligolu, asengika hela ndaba jukugone. </char></note>.” Sauli jajumuka lukela ngani na boa abeli, jombi na Samweli, bapita nukulonguana mu indela. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Ebahika ku mwisu ja musi, Samweli ampwagila Sauli, “Mpwagila nkombu hoju julonguliya palongi jitu.” Nkombu pajabiya juboi, Samweli jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Lenda oti ngiti nugubola goti gajumbwagi Sapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ndipala, Samweli jajukua lisupa lisoku la mahuta anzakania Sauli pamutu, anzobatiya nu kumpwagi, “Bambu Sapanga jugujakani mahuta gubia wa bambu nkolongu jukwaalongosa bandu baki. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Lelenu patwitabukana, wiiketangana na bandu abeli pambipi ni litenge laka Laheli ku Selusa mundema wa Benjamini. Haba bagupwagila kubanga maponda gawabiya gutaputa gapatakini. Atati baku akotwiki kuholale majambu giliponda, ila abii ni kiholu kupete wehapa, bililaluki kila lisoba, ‘Nhenga kii kwa ndaba ja bana bangu?’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Kuhuma hapa wiijenda ku nkongu nkolongu uku Taboli, pandu jehapa wiketangana na akanalomi atatu abii mwiindela kujenda kumpiki Sapanga matambiku ku Beteli. Jumu wabu jibiya julongulaki tumbui tutatu, jwa pili jibiya jutotwi mabumunda matatu na jwa tatu jibiya jutotwi kiliba sa divai. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Bagulamukiya nu kugupeke mabumunda mabeli, nanagu wagajopa kuhuma kwabu. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Ndienu, pawiihika ku Gibea Eloimu, pandu palibii likambi la alonda buku Filisti, pawibiya uguhegale musi, wiketangana ni likundi la alota. Alota haba bibiya ahuluka kuhuma pandu pukunndumbali Bambu Sapanga koni ahona ihemba ni ilimba na pyelembi ni ing'oma babiya atenda kulondola. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Loho jaka Bambu Sapanga jaguhikila kwa makili, nanamu wiitumbuliya kulondoo pamu nabombi nukung'anambuka kuba mundu jongi. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Kipindi majambu haga pagagupitila, sokapi sewiwesa kuhenga wiihenga, ndaba Sapanga jubii pamu na wehapa. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Winonguliya kujenda ku musi uku Giligali, pandu paniketangana nu kupia matambiku gukutini na matambiku gu lukwali. Winendaliya hapa kwa masoba saba mbaka enihika nukugulangi sukuhenga.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli pajang'anambuka ili kunndeka Samweli, Sapanga jang'anambua mwoju waka Sauli. Goti Samweli gaampwagila gapitila lisoba lelele. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sauli nu ntumisi waki ebahika ku Gibea, jaketangana ni likundi la alota. Loho jaka Sapanga junhikila kwa makili, na Sauli jatumbuliya kulota pamu na alota haba. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Bandu babummanyiki Sauli pu utumbuli, pabummbona jutenda kulota, balaluana, “Sindu bo sesumpatiki mwana waka Kishe? Boo Sauli lee najombi ndi jumu jwa alota?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Mundu jumu jojabia jutama hoku jalalukia, “Boo atati babu ndi nyane?” Ndienu, gapitila malobi gagapwaaga, “Boo, Sauli lee najombi ndi jumu jwa alota?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli pajajomula kulota, jajenda kukitombi pandu pukundumbali Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Atati asoku baka Sauli ejaabona Sauli nu ntumisi jaalalukiya, “Mwakabii kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Sauli jajibua, “Twapiti kugataputa maponda, na hetwabona ngasegapatikana, twapiti kummbona Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Atati baki asoku baka Sauli bala ampwagila, “Mpepa koku mbwagila sejugupwagi Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli jajibua, “Jutupwagila hotuhotu kubanga maponda gapatakini.” Lakini Sauli ngaseampwagi kubanga Samweli ampwagi jiibiya bambu nkolongu.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli antangasa kuba bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Samweli jaakema bandu boti akusanyika palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ku Mizipa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Pabahika jaapwagila, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizilaeli, jupwaaga ana. Naaboa Aizilaeli kuhuma ku nndema uku Misili, nukuhokua mwanganya kuhuma kwa Amisili na ulongosi gongi gogunkamulaki. <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Lakini lelenu nnganiki nepani Sapanga winu jojunhokua kuhuma mu mang'aliku nu ubini winu, nanamu mpwaagiki, ‘Ngaela, utuhaguliya bambu nkolongu jutulongusa,’ ndienu nkusanyika mwaboti palongi jangu koni mmbiya mu makabila ginu nu lukolu lwinu.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Ndienu, Samweli jagapanga makabila goti guku Izilaeli, likabila la Benjamini bilisagula sukulipege gudugudu. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Jilileta palongi likabila la Benjamini, kulengana nu lukolu yaki, nu lukolu lwa Matili banhagula kwa gudugudu. Mwisu jululeta lukolu lwaka matili na Sauli mwana waka Kishi ndi joanhagula sukupega gudugudu. Lakini pabumtaputa ngasebummbona. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Bunndalukiya kabee Sapanga, “Boo jubii mundu jongi kabee jojuhika?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Bambu Sapanga jaajibua, “Hena, jujobiki pikilanda ji misigu.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ndienu, bajenda imbelu, buntaputa Sauli nukunndeta. Sauli pajabiya jujemiki kati ja bandu jabiya nndasu kupeta bandu boti bunhikila mu mabega. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samweli jaapwagila bandu boti, “Hajo ndi mundu Sapanga joanhagwi mu bandu boti, ngakuba jokapi jojubii ngati jombi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Bandu boti bajamaliya kupwaaga, “Bambu nkolongu jutama yaka yoti.”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Ndienu, Samweli jaalandila bandu kupete lihengu nu kulongosa kwaka bambu nkolongu, jaandika mu kitabu sesuse jikibeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. Ndienu Samweli jaatabuka bandu boti, kila mundu jujenda kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Ndipala, Sauli pamu na akomana ngondu bababii pu utumbuli Sapanga jagusa mioju jabu, jajenda ku nyumba jaki ku musi uku Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Lakini bandu bangi babi ni milomu, bapwaaga, “Boo, mundu hajo juwesa kutuokoa?” Bunndongama Sauli na ngasebumpekia nhupi jokapi. Lakini jombi Sauli ngasejayomike.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sauli jaawesa bandu buku Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Ndipala, bambu nkolongu Naashi jwa Aamoni, jajenda nu kuuyongolota musi uku Yabeshi Gileadi. Bandu ba musi uku Gileadi bumpwagila Naashi, “Jongana na twepani, natwatu tugutumakiyaje.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Lakini ampwaagila, “Niijongana na mwanganya kwi lilaganu limu ana nuntupula lihu luku malele kila jumu winu, ndi niibiya naapoiki lihamu Aizilaeli boti.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Aseja buku Yabeshi bumpwagila, “Utupekiya masoba saba ili twaatuma atenga mu nndema uku Izilaeli. Ana nga mundu jokapi jukutuokoa, twalilamisa twabeti kwaku.” <verse eid="1SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Atenga bala pabahika ku musi uku Gibea, kojutamika Sauli, balandila majambu gehaga na bandu boti batumbuliya kulela kwa sauti ngolongu.<verse eid="1SA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Henu Sauli jabiya juhuma ku litui jubii na makambaku gaki, jalalukiya, “Bandu haba abii na kyane? Ndaba jakii atenda kulela?” Bumpwagila majambu gabaleta atenga kuhuma ku Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Apalapa, Sauli pajajoa majambu haga, Loho jaka Sapanga junhikila kwa makili, najombi jayomiki ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Jajukua makambaku mabeli ga ng'ombi jagasekulana ipandi ipandi, jaatuma atenga apetisa kila pandu pa Izilaeli kupwaaga, “Mundu jokapi jojwisidwa kumpwata Sauli na Samweli ku ngondu, makambaku gaki ga ng'ombi bagasekulana ana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 11:7">Bambu Sapanga jaahenga bandu buku Izilaeli ajogupa ndaba juwesa kuhenga, ndienu boti bapita pamu. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli jaakusanya Aizilaeli ku Bezeki jabiya na bandu elupu itatu kuhuma ku Izilaeli na bandu elupu selasini kuhuma ku Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Sauli jaapwagila atenga bababia atenda kubuja kuhuma ku Yabeshi. “Mwaapwagila ana bandu buku Yabeshi Gileadi. Twaanhokua kilabu muhi lyoba palikuba libala ngani, mwiibiya nkombuliwi.” Bandu buku Yabeshi pabapata majambu haga batoguli ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Bandu ba musi uku Yabeshi bumpwagila Naashi, “Kilabu twalilamisa kwaku na wehapa watuhengila lokapi leulibona laamboni.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Lisoba heli ikilu jela Sauli jaabagula bandu mu ikosi itatu. Ekwahika pulukela pajingala mu likambi la Aamoni nukutumbuli kukomana naku. Babanusulika batawanyika liya, wala ngasesabii kikundi sesabii na bandu hata abeli pamu.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Ndipala, Aizilaeli bumpwagila Samweli, “Abii kwaa bandu babapwaaga Sauli jiikuba bambu nkolongu kwitu twenga? Utuletila bandu haba, natwepani ngiti tutenda kwaakoma.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Lakini Sauli jaapwagila, “Nga mundu hata jumu jojakakomika lelenu, ndaba mu lisoba lende, Bambu Sapanga jugukombwi nndema Izilaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Samweli jaapwagila, “Tujenda twaboa ku Giligali na kwa mala jengi tukuntangasa Sauli kuba bambu nkolongu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Bandu boti bajenda ku Giligali, na pabahika hoku, bunhimika Sauli kuba bambu nkolongu pandu pukunndumbali Bambu Sapanga. Bumpikia Bambu Sapanga litambiku lu lukwali. Na Sauli pamu na bandu boti buku Izilaeli batogulii ngamaa.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Samweli julongee na Aizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samweli jaapwagila bandu buku Izilaeli boti, “Goti gambwagi, nagajoini. Nunhimika bambu nkolongu ili jundongua. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Henu, mmbii na bambu nkolongu jukunndongosa. Lakini nepani sajenu nu nseja, na bana bangu akanalomi abii pamu na mwanganya. Mii ni kilongosi winu tumbuka panabii nu nkombu mbaka sajenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Mii pamba ana nahengiki lijambu lokapi liliya, ndienu nndandila palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga na palongi jaka bambu nkolongu winu joanhagwi. Boo Nyagiki makambaku ga ng'ombi au maponda gaka mundu jokapi? Boo, nunhengi le liya mundu jokapi? Boo, nunhinyalaki mundu jokapi? Boo nyopiki hongu kwaka mundu jokapi ili kutemu sanga kupalika? Ana nhengiki hela ngiti ndenda kukelabuki yoti.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Bandu bajibua, “Kye ngasegutukongiki, wala ngaseutulimbalaki wala ngasegujukwi sindu sokapi kwaka mundu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samweli jajibua, “Bambu Sapanga ndi jojugabweni nukujoana kuhuma kwinu mwanganya, na bambu nkolongu waki joanhagwi lelenu ndi jojagabweni nukujoana kubanga ngasemii ni likosa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Bombi bajibua, “Jombi ndi jojagabweni nukujoana.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />“Samweli jaapwagila kabee, Bambu Sapanga ndi joanhagula Musa na Aloni na kwaapia akahoku binu ku nndema uku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Ndienu nnzemaninya pammbii hapa ili nepani na mwanganya tutemuliwa palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, nanepani ngiti numpwagila kupete mahengu gaki ga nginyuli gajagahenga ili kunhokoo mwanganya na akahoku binu. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Kipindi Yakobu na alongu baki pabajenda ku Misili, na Amisili pababiya atenda kwaang'alisa akahoku binu, na akahoku binu banndelila Bambu Sapanga, najombi jaatuma Musa na Aloni babube ndi babaapia akahoku binu mundema uku Misili nu kunhenga ntama mu nndema gongo. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Lakini bombi bunzewiki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wabu, najombi jaaleka Apilisiti na bambu nkolongu juku Moabu na Sisela jojabii nkolongu ja alonda ku Azoli baalapula. Milema joti jakomana na akahoku binu na kaawesa. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Akahoku binu bundelila Bambu Sapanga, bapwaaga, ‘Tuhengiki mahakau kwa ndaba tugulei wehapa wa Bambu Sapanga, sukuitumaki Mabaali na Maashitaloti. Utuhenga tuwesa kwaawesa abaja bitu natwepani twagulumbaliya wehapa.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga paantuma Gidioni na mwenikatai antuma Bedani au Balaka. Kabee antuma Yefuta na mwisu waki janduma nepani Samweli. Kila jumu witu jaokua kuhuma mwa abaja binu babuyongaliti nanamu mwakatama su lukwali. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Lakini pamummbona bambu nkolongu Naashi jwa Aamoni jupala kuhika kukomana nabu, munkana Bambu Sapanga jojuwe ndi Bambu nkolongu winu, mwambwagila, ‘Ngahela bambu nkolongu ndi jojatulongusa.’<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />“Henu bambu nkolongu jomulihaguliya ndi jonzo. Mundoba Bambu Sapanga jumpekiya bambu nkolongu, najombi jumpeki. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Ana muntende isima Bambu Sapanga nu kuntumaki nu kunzoane Sapanga sanga kukotoka kuhenga sejulagalaki. Ana mwanganya mwabeti pamu na bambu nkolongu ana mumpwatiki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ndienu majambu ginu giijenda sapi. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Lakini ananga kunzoane Bambu Sapanga, nukukotoka kuhenga ngati ejalagalaki, ndienu jombi jwikomana na mwanganya pamu na bambu nkolongu winu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Ndienu, ntulia nukulilingali lijambu heli likolongu lelule Bambu Sapanga jiihenga palongi jinu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Boo, sajenu lee nga kipindi sukuhusa ingano? Lakini nepani naandoba Bambu Sapanga juleta itobi ni iyula, nanamu mwiimanya nu kubona kihakau sinu semwahengiki palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga sukupala bumpekiya bambu nkolongu ndi kihakua se kitei kukola.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ndienu, Samweli anndoba Bambu Sapanga, najombi jatuma kitobi ni iyula mu lisoba heli. Bandu boti baajogopa ngamaa Bambu Sapanga na Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Ndienu bandu boti bumpwagila Samweli, “Gupepa koku, gutulobila twepani twaatumisi baku kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku ili twiikua, ndaba tuhengiki mahakau makolongu ni kihakau hesi sukumpala bambu nkolongu witu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samweli jaajibua, “Mwiijogopa, jeni pee nhengiki mahakau haga, mwiikotoka kupwata Bambu Sapanga ila mutuntumakiya kwa mwoju winu woti. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Mwaaipwata isapanga yi isoli yanga na faida wala ngajiiwesi kunhokoa, ndaba isapanga yi isoli. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Kwa ndaba jaka mweni Bambu Sapanga ngajaaleke bandu baki kwa ndaba kunndengani mwanganya mmbia mwabandu baki. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Kabee kwangu nepani nganiikotoki kunndobe kwaka Bambu Sapanga, ana ngotwiki kunndobe nibiya ndei kihakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. Niiendaliya kumbola indela jaki jaamboni na ju usakaka. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Ndienu, mwanganya mundumbaliya Bambu Sapanga nu kuntumaki sukunhobale kwa mwoju winu woti. Nkombuka majambu makolongu gajunhengi Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Lakini ana nhendali kuhenga mahakau, mwikuwa tipitipi mwanganya pamu na bambu nkolongu winu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli akomana na Apilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sauli jabii na yaka selasini, pajabiya bambu nkolongu, jalongusa Izilaeli yaka alubaini ni mibeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli jaahagula alonda elupu itatu kuhuma pikilanda ja bandu buku Izilaeli. Alonda elupu ibeli jutamika naku jombi ku Mikimashi mwi itombi yuku Beteli. Nabombi alonda elupu jimu babiya pamu na Yonasani ku Gibea nndema uku Benjamini. Alonda bangi babahigali jaapwagila kila mundu jubuja kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonasani jaashambulia ngomi ja Apilisti ku Geba na Apilisti bajoana majambu haga. Ndienu Sauli jaalagalakiya ajemba imbata nndema woti nu kutangasa, “Aebulania ajoana!” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Ndienu Aizilaeli boti bajoana majambu kupwaaga, “Sauli jusambulii ngomi ja Apilisti, nahenu Apilisiti baasuki ngamaa, Aizilaeli baakema kujenda kujongana na Sauli ku Giligali.”<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Nabombi Apilisti bakusanyika ili kukomana na Aizilaeli koni abii na magali elupu itatu na alonda elupu sita babakwela maponda ni likundi la alonda baajenda kwa magolu bingi ngati nsangi ukujenda ku mbwani, boti bakwela panani nu kutama ku Mikimashi, upandi golipiti lyoba uku Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Aizilaeli boti ebalinga abii mu mang'aliku batumbuliya kujoba. Bangi bajoba mu makolu, bangi mu mabomba na bangi mu malibu na bangi mu matenge na bangi mwi iliba yanga na masi. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Bangi baalombuka losi lwa Yoludani mbaka ku nndema uku Gadi nu nndema uku Gileadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Lakini Sauli jabiya jakona ku Giligali alonda boti babumpwatiki koni abagaja kwi kiholu. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sauli anndendila Samweli kwa masoba saba, ngati Samweli ejapwaaga. Lakini Samweli ngasejahiki ku Giligali na bandu batumbuliya kunndeka Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Ndienu, Sauli jaapwagila bandu, “Netila matambiku ginu gukutini gala nu gulukwali.” Najombi jaapia matambiku gu kutini. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Apalapa pajajomula pee kupia matambiku gukutini, Samweli jatenda kuhika. Sauli japita kunza kujenda kumpengana Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samweli anndalukiya, “Guhengiki kyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sauli anzibua, “Panabona alonda bangu atenda kuneka na wehapa ngaseguhiki kwa masoba gawapwagiki, na kabee panaabona Apilisti alipangiki kukomana ku Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />naholaliya ana Apilisti biika kushambulii ku Giligali. Kabee nabiya ngasembiiki litambi ili kunndoba Bambu Sapanga junyangatiya. Ndienu nabona ngasemii na sengi sukuhenga ndienu napalika kupia namweti matambiku gukutini.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samweli anzibua Sauli, “Guhengiki ung'ang'a. Ngasewajetaki ejugulagalakiya Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku. Ana ukunzoani Bambu Sapanga jukuguhenga guendaliya kulongosa wehapa na bana baku ku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Lakini henu ubambu ukolongu waku ngagutamaki ndaba miilu jejugulagalakiya Bambu Sapanga ngase ujijetaki. Bambu Sapanga jutapwiti mundu jongi jojuwe jiitenda kunnzetake kwa mwoju woti, na hoju ndi joanhagwi kuba kilongosi jakwaalongosa bandu baki.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Samweli jaboka kuhuma ku Giligali nu kujenda ku Gibea mu nndema wi likabila la Benjamini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:15">Sauli pajaabalanga alonda bajabii naku, jabona abii alonda mia sita pena. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli na mwana waki Yonasani, pamu na alonda bajabii naku, batama kambi ku Gibea mu nndema wi likabila la Benjamini na Apilisti batami ku Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Apilisti baboka mu likambi labu kujenda kwaashambuli babiya abii ikundi itatu. Kikundi simu sajenda ku Opula mu ndema waka Shuali. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Kikundi sengi sajenda ku Beti Holoni ni kikundi sengi sajenda indela juku ligomba luku Seboimu, kujenda ku lukoba.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Kipindi sehesi ngasejabii mundu jojuhugati mu nndema gwoa guku Izilaeli, ndaba Apilisiti bapangi kwapengale Aebulania ili bilenganake mipanga ni mikoa. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Kila Nizilaeli japalika kwaajende Apilisti kuyola ligela lukuhutwa na ng'ombi au sulu au lipengu au kijipi sukuhusi. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Aizilaeli babiya alepa ipandi ibeli ya Shekeli kuyola ligela na suluu. Na lupija lukuyole lipengu na magela yabiya kipandi simu sa shekeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ndienu lisoba heli mu ngondu ngasejwabii mundu jokapi jojabii nu upanga wala nkoa kati ja bandu buku Izilaeli ila pee Sauli na Yonasani jojabii mwana waki.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Apilisti bapelika kikundi sa alonda kujenda kulenda pandu pukulobuke ku Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani jubii nganganganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Lisoba limu, Yonasani mwana waka bambu nkolongu Sauli ampwagila nkombu joantotuli hindu yukukomane, “Hikaje tujenda kwii ku ngomi ja Apilisti.” Lakini Yonasani ngasejaapwagi atati baki. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sauli jabiya jubei kambi ja pai ju nkongu nkomamanga ku Migiloni, kunza ja musi uku Gibea, koni jubii na alonda mia sita. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Ahiya mwana waka Ahitubu nndongu waka Ikabodi mwana waka Finehasi nu nsokoo waka Eli, mngolu waka Bambu Sapanga ku musi uku Shilu, jabiya ndi jojuweti kizibau saka nngolu. Bandu ngasebamanyiki ana Yonasani jutei kuboka.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Mu kandela kajapeta ka Mikimashi, Yonasani japalika jupetila ili juhika mu ngomi ja Apilisti, kwabii na malibu mabeli gagahonguliki, upandi gongo nu upandi gongi. Lilibu limu bilikema Bosesi na lengi bilikema Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Lilibu limu labiya upandi uku kasikazini mwa musi uku Mikimashi ni lilibu lengi labiya upandi ukusini pambipi na musi uku Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonasani ampwagila nkombu jola joantotuli hindu yukukomane, “Hika tujenda ku likambi la bandu banga kummanya Sapanga. Pangi kwa Bambu Sapanga juwesa kutujangati kuwesa bandu haba, ndaba Bambu Sapanga ngasejuoko sukuhobale bandu bingi au bandu asoku.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Nkombu jojatotwi hindu yukukomane ampwagila, “Henga sokapi segupala kuhenga, nepani mii pamu na wehapa ndaba leguholale heli ndi leninhenga nepani.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonasani ampwagila, “Tulombuka twaajendila bandu bala ili atubonaje. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Ana apwagiki twaalendila, mbaka ahika pamba patubii ndienu ngiti tujema apamba na wala ngatujende. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Lakini ana apwagiki tujenda, ndienu ngiti tujenda ndaba heji ndi nginyuli kuba Bambu Sapanga jutuhengiki twaawesa.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Ndienu boti abeli bapitila ili Apilisti baabona. Apilisti pababona bapwaaga, “Nndinga Aebulania bala ahuma mu mabomba mobabii ajobiki.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Apilisti baabii mu ngomi bunkema Yonasani nu nkombu joantotuli hindu yukukomane, “Hika kwitu kongo, natwepani ngiti tundangia sindu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Yonasani ampwagila nkombu jola, “Mbwata, Bambu Sapanga jutuhengiki twaawesa.” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Ndienu, Yonasani jakwela kwa maboku na magolu nu nkombu jola jatenda kumpwata. Yonasani jaasambuliya Apilisiti na kwaabua pai nu nkombu jola jupwata munyuma jutenda kwaakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Yonasani jatumbuliya kukomana, koni jubii nu nkombu jojatotwi hindu yukukomane, jaakoma ngati alonda ba Apilisiti ishilini mu lieneu lelihika nusu heka. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Mu nndema wa Apilisiti, bandu boti batenda kujogopa, kabee na alonda mu likambi na bandu mu matui na alonda bababii mu ngomi, hata babakomana batenda kubagaja, nndema watenda kubagaja, na kwabii ni kiholu kikolongu.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apilisti atenda kusindwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Alonda baka Sauli ku Gibea mu nndema waka Benjamini baabona alonda biki Pilisiti bingi atenda kutilani na ngasebanyiki sukuhenga. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli jaapwagila bandu bajabii naku, “Mulibalanga ili kumanya aka nya babututiliki.” Pabilibalanga bamanya Yonasani nu nkombu jojatotwi hindu yukukomane ngasebabii. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli ampwagila nngolu Ahiya, “Leta Lisanduku laka Sapanga.” Kipindi sehesi Lisanduku li Lilaganu labia pamu na Aizilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Sauli pajabiya jakona jakalonge nu nngolu, ngondu mu likambi la Apilisti yatenda kujonzukeka nakanopi. “Ndienu Sauli ampwagila nngolu wiileta kabee Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Sapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ndienu, Sauli na bandu baki biliandia kujingii mu kukomana ngondu kwa Apilisiti. Lakini Apilisiti batumbuliya kukomana beni na beni. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Aebulania bababii upandi wa Apilisti, na babapiti naku kulikambi bang'anambuka nu kujongana na Aizilaeli bababii pamu na Sauli na Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Hata Aizilaeli bangi babiya ajobiki munndema wi itombi yuku Efulaimu, pabajoa Apilisti babiya atenda kutila, na bombi kabee baabenga na kwaalapu.<verse eid="1SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Hela ndi Bambu Sapanga jaajangatiya Aizilaeli kuwesa. Ngondu jaendaliya mbaka musi uku Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majambu gagapitila ngondu ejajomuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Lisoba lela, Aizilaeli baasumbwi ngamaa ndaba Sauli jabiya jaalapisi alonda koni jupwaaga, “Mundu jokapi jojikula posu kabula ja lyoba kujingi, na kabula jukulepa kisasi kwa abaja bangu jupata yambamba.” Ndienu lisoba loti, nga mundu jojaonza posu jokapi. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Alonda boti pabahika pandu pakibii kiholi, bugukolila busi guhabuka kila pandu. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Hata hela alonda pabahika mwikiholi nu kugukole busi wakatona mandondu kila pandu, ngamundu jojalenga kula busi hogu kujogopa lilaganu lepajaalapila. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Lakini Yonasani ngasejajoini atati baki ejaalapisa alonda. Ndienu jatondabiya ndonga jaki jejabii naku, jatobakiya mu lisega la busi, jakula busi we hogu. Hapa jilijoaninya jubii na makili. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Mundu jumu ampwagila, “Atati baku jaalapisa alonda su ukali kupwaaga, ‘Mundu jokapi jojikula posu lelenu jiipata yaambamba.’” Ndi ndaba waabona bandu boti pamba atei kusoka ni inzala.<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonasani jajibua, “Atati bangu baasumbuu bandu. Henu nepani nilijoane mii na makili, ndaba honziki busi kidogo. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ana pee alonda bitu bakakuliki kidogu kuhuma mu hindu yeanyagiki kwa abaja babu, ndi bakapata makili na kwaakoma Apilisti bingi ngamaa.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Lisoba lela, Aizilaeli baalapula Apilisti, tumbuka ku Mikimashi mbaka ku Aiyaloni. Lakini kipindi sehesi Aizilaeli asokiki kwi inzala. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Ndienu batilila hindu yebanyagiki kwa makili kuhuma kwa Apilisiti, bajukua makondoo na makambaku na matoli na basinza bakula inyama mbei jejibii na mwai. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Bandu bangi bumpwagila Sauli, “Linga bandu bahenga mahakau kwaka Bambu Sapanga kwa kula inyama jejibii na mwai.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Sauli jaapwagila bandu, “Mwanganya nhengiki kihakau, nhingaliya lilibu likolongu lelale pamii pamba.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Sauli jaapwagila, “Nzendaninya mwakaapwagila bandu boti aleta ng'ombi na makondoo gabu pamba, asinza na kula pamba. Biitenda mahakau kupete Bambu Sapanga, sa kula inyama jejibii na mwai.” Ndienu ikilu jela joti bapelika ng'ombi yabu nukusinza papu. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ndienu, Sauli ansengila Bambu Sapanga pandu pukupiki matambiku. Hapa ndi pabiya pandu pukupiki matambiki pu utumbuli papuje Sauli ansengila Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Ndienu, Sauli jaapwagila bandu. “Tujenda twakaapwata Apilisti ikilu, twakaajobaliya na kwaanyaga mali gabu mbaka pulukela, ngatwaandeki mundu jokapi mwomi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Bandu ampwagila, “Nhenga sokapi segukibona ndi sasapi kwaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Lakini nngolu jaapwagila, “Tuloba oti kwaka Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ndienu, Sauli anndalukiya Sapanga, “Boo, nyenda kukomana na Apilisiti? Boo winyangatiya twaawesaje?” Lakini Sapanga ngaseanzibua sindu sokapi lisoba heli. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Sauli jaapwaga, “Nhikaninya mwakakilongosi ba bandu, ili tumanya mahakau boo gatuhengiki lelenu. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi na jojuwe jaokua Aizilaeli, hata ngati ndi mwanawa Yonasani, jupalika kuwa.” Lakini nga mundu jojupwaaga lilobi. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Ndienu, Sauli ampwagila, “Mwanganya mwaboti nzemaninya upandi golago, ndienu nepani na Yonasani twiijenda upandi gongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Bombi bajibua, “Henga sokapi segubona saamboni.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Sauli jaapwaaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga wa Aizilaeli, ndaba ngasegunyibwiki nepani nu ntumisi waku? Mwaa Bambu Sapanga jwa Izilaeli, ana mahakau gabii nakati jangu nepani au Yonasani mwanangu, ndienu, ututemula kwi lilibu lukutemuli. Lakini ana kubii makosa haga gabii kwa bandu baku buku Iizilaeli, amua ku lilibu lukutemuli la Sumimu.” Yonasani na Sauli babonikana kuba na mahakau, lakini bandu babonikana ngaseabii mahakau. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Sauli japwaaga, “Mpega gudugudu kati jangu na mwanangu Yonasani.” Yonasani jabonikana kuba na mahakau. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ndienu Sauli ampwagila Yonasani, “Mbwagila seguhengiki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Yonasani jajibua, “Nakuliki busi kidogu kukutumii ndonga jangu. Mii pamba na mii tayali kuwa.”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sauli jaapwaga, “Nunndoba Sapanga jungoma ana nganankomi jojuhengiki hela.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Lakini alonda bumpwagila Sauli, “Mbona Yonasani ndi jojutuhenga tuwesaje henu tunkomaje? Lijambu leheli libia kutali. Tulapi kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, hata lijunzu lu mumutu waki ngalihabuki pai. Sejwikihengiki lelenu, Bambu Sapanga jutei kunzangatila.” Ndienu, alonda bunkombula Yonasani najombi ngasebunkomiki.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Ndienu Sauli jakotuka kwaapwatali Apilisiti, nabombi Apilisiti bakelubuka kwabu.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongosi waka Sauli na alongu baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sauli ejabiya bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, jakomana na abaja baki kila upandi. Jaakomana na Amoabu na Aamoni na Aedomu na bambu nkolongu juku Sola na Apilisti. Kila ejukomana nabu ngondu jutendika kwaawesa. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Jukomana su uwesu nkolongu, jaawesa Aamaleki. Jaokua Aizilaeli kuhuma mwa bandu boti baakomana naku.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Bana akanalomi baka Sauli babiya Yonasani na Ishivi na Malikishua. Akakamwali baki babii abeli, ju kutumbuli ankema Melabu nu nsoku akema Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Nhwanu waka Sauli ankemika Ahinoamu kamwali waka Ahimaasi. Nndonda jwa alonda baka Sauli ankema Abineli, mwana waka Neli atati asoku baka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Atati baka Sauli babiya Kishi na atati baka Abineli babiya Neli mwana waka Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Kwabii nu kukomana kukolongu kati ja Apilisti kipindi soti saka Sauli pajabii jutama mu nndema, kila kipindi Sauli pajupatika mundu jojubii na makili au nkolongu anzukua nu kunzingisa mu ulonda.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli akomana na Aamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samweli ampwagila Sauli, “Bambu Sapanga janduma kunnzakani mahuta gubiya wa bambu nkolongu wa bandu baki buku Izilaeli. Ndienu gujoaninya malobi gaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Bambu Sapanga ju ulonda jupwaaga ana, ‘Naalapula Aamaleki boti ndaba baalapula Aizilaeli pababiya ahuma ku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Ndienu jenda kaalapula nu kwaakoma tipitipi hindu yoti yebabii naku. Waaleka abiya bomi ila wakaakoma bandu boti. Akanalomi na akammbomba bana akeki na akanyongo, ng'ombi na makondoo na ngamia na maponda.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Sauli jaakema alonda baki, jaakagula ku Telaimu. Kwabii na alonda baajenda kwa magolu laki ibeli kuhuma ku Izilaeli nuku Yuda babii elupu komi. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Ndienu jombi na bandu baki bajenda ku musi uku Amaleki, babiya baajobale ku ligomba. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sauli jaapwagila Akeni, “Nzendaninya! Mmbokannya! Mmbokannya pikilanda ja Aamaleki anangaela ngiti naakoma pamu nabombi. Mmbokannya kwa ndaba mwanganya mwahengii gaamboni Aizilaeli pabahuma ku Misili.” Ndienu Akeni baboka pikilanda ja Aamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Sauli jaalapula na kwaawesa Aamaleki kutumbuli ku Havila mbaka ku Shuli upandi golipiti lyoba ku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Ankamula bambu nkolongu Agagi jwa Aamaleki pajabii mwomi. Jaakoma bandu kwa ngondu. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Lakini Sauli na alonda baki ngaseankomiki bambu nkolongu Agagi wala makondoo gagakendiki ngani, ng'ombi yeikendiki ngani na matoli ga makondoo gagakendiki na sokapi sela sesabii saamboni ngasebikikomike. Lakini hindu yoti iliya na yanga na bei ngolongu batenda kwiikoma.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu Sapanga ankana Sauli kuba bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Samweli, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Niligana ngamaa nunhengiki Sauli kuba bambu nkolongu. Jombi jukotwiki kumbwata nepani na ngasejijihenga mihilu jangu.” Lakini Samweli jayomiki ngamaa, andobila kwaka Bambu Sapanga ikilu joti koni julela. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samweli jajoana kubanga Sauli jabiya juhikiki ku Kalumeli na jugujemiki nnala waki ili bandu buntendila isima, nu jupiti ku Giligali. Ndienu kilabu jaki, Samweli jajumuka pulukela ngani jajenda kuketangana na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Samweli paanhikila Sauli, Sauli ampwagila Samweli, “Bambu Sapanga jugupengila! Nhengiki mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samweli ampwagila, “Ana sakaka boo kumetale kwa makondoo nu kupongale kwa ng'ombe ako kuhumi kwako?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli jajibua, “Bandu bagaleka makondoo na ng'ombi yeikendiki ngani ili kumpiki matambiku Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, lakini bangi boti twaakomiki.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samweli ampenga Sauli, “Tumbala! Ngiti nugupwagila lijambu lejumbwagi Bambu Sapanga lelenu ikilu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Sauli jaapwaga, “Mbwagila.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samweli ampwagila, “Hata ngati ulibona wehapa ngasegumanayakini, boo, wehapa le nga ukilongosi wa makabila goti guku Izilaele? Bambu Sapanga jugujakania mahuta gubiya gwa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Bambu Sapanga pajugutuma jugupwagila, ‘Jenda wakaakoma Aamaleki boti baahengiki mahakau, gukomana nabu mbaka waakoma boti!’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Ndaba jakii, ngasegunnzoane Bambu Sapanga? Ndaba jakii waabutukiya kunyaga hindu yabu ya sapi nukuhenga majambu gangakunndengane Bambu Sapanga?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli jajibua, “Nunzoani Bambu Sapanga. Najenda kojandumiki Bambu Sapanga, nunkamwi nukundeta bambu nkolongu jwa Aamaleki Agagi na naakomiki tipitipi Aamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Lakini alonda ngasebakomiki inyama yeikendiki yeyuye ndi, makondoo na ng'ombi yeikendiki na hindu yoti yeibii yaamboni, ila ailetiki pani pa Giligali ili kumpiki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Ndienu Samweli ampwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">“Boo, Bambu Sapanga jupala nakanopi kike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">matambiku gukutini na matambiko lena?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">kupeta kunnzoane Sapanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">Linga, kunnzetake jombi ndi kwaamboni kupeta matambiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">nu kunzoane jombi ndi kwaamboni kupeta kumpiki mahuta gi lipongu. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kunng'anambuka mundu kulengana nu mahakau guhabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">ni ing'omu ilengana ni kihakau sukuilumbali imong'umong'u.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">Ndaba ujikaniki mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">najombi jugukaniki wiikuba wa bambu nkolongu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sauli ampwagila Samweli, “Nhengiki mahakau. Nng'anambwiki mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga ni mihilu jaku, ndaba naajogopa bandu, nakwaajoane bombi. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Lakini henu nuguloba, gunekakiya mahakau gangu. Nyetakaliya ngelubuka pamu nawehapa ili nhwesa kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samweli jajibua, “Kyee nganhwesi kukelabuka pamu nawehapa. Wehapa gukaniki mihilu jaka Bambu Sapanga, najombi jugukaniki wehapa kuba wa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samweli jang'anambuka ili juboka, Sauli jakamula lupeta lwi ingobu jaki nalwombi lwatenda kujenduka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Ndienu Samweli ampwagila Sauli, “Kutumbuli lelenu Bambu Sapanga jujendwii ubambu ukolongu waku ku Izilaeli, kuhuma kwaku na ngiti ampekiya mundu jongi bapambipi jaku baabii baamboni kupeta wehapa. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Sapanga jojubii nu ulumbi guku Izilaeli ngasejupwaga isoli, wala ngasejung'anambu liwasu laki. Ndaba jombi ngamundu mbaka kung'anambuu mawasu gaki.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli jajibua, “Nhengiki mahakau. Hata hela wiimboa lihamu palongi ja aseja na bandu bangu na Aizilaeli. Gunyetakaliya ngelubuka na wehapa ili nu kunndumbaliya Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ndienu, Samweli jakelubuka pamu najombi mbaka ku Giligali na Sauli anndumbaliya Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Ndienu, Samweli jaapwaga, “Netila pamba Agagi bambu nkolongu juku Amaleki.” Agagi annzendila Samweli koni jutogulee ndaba jaholaliya, “Ngabaakome.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samweli japwaaga, “Suupanga upanga waku wahengiki akambomba bingi biikuba na bana, ndienu na akanyongo baku ebibiya sanga mwana kati jaka akanyongo.” Ansekulana Agagi ipandi ipandi palongi ja pandu pukupiki litambiku laka Bambu Sapanga ku Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Ndienu, Samweli jajenda ku Lama na bambu nkolongu Sauli jakelubuka ku nyumba jaki ku Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kutumbulii lisoba heli, Samweli ngaseammbona kabee Sauli, mbaka lisoba lejakuwa. Hata hela Samweli anndelila Sauli. Najombi Bambu Sapanga jayoma ndaba jabiya anzakanii mahuta Sauli kuba bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daudi bunnzakani mahuta ili jubiya bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Samweli, “Wandelila Sauli mbaka lile? Wehapa gumanyiki nepani nunkaniki jwiikuba bambu nkolongu ku Izilaeli. Henu twelakiya linyelu laku mahuta gi mizeituni, guboka. Nagutuma kwaka Yese juku musi uku Beteleemu, ndaba nunhagwi bambu nkolongu kati ja bana baki.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samweli jaapwaaga, “Niiwesaboo kujenda? Ana Sauli anajujoaini majambu haga jiitenda kungoma!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Jukua litoli pamu nawehapa, anaguhiki hoku wakapwaaga, ‘Nhikiki kumpiki Bambu Sapanga matambiku gukutinii.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Nkoka Yese mu matambiku haga nanepani nagulangia sukuhenga. Wampakia mahuta ndaba jangu mundu jonaguloguliya.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samweli jahenga ngati ebumpwagila Bambu Sapanga, jajenda ku Beteleemu. Akakilongosi ba musi we hogu bapita nukujenda kunzopa koni abagaja bukunndaluki, “Boo, guhikiki ku lukwale?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samweli jaapwagila, “Nhikiki ku lukwali. Nhikiki kumpiki matambiku Bambu Sapanga. Mulinyambisa mwabete tujenda kupia matambiku.” Samweli annyambisa Yese pamu na bana baki, jaakalibisa mu litambiku.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Pabahika, Samweli eammbona Eliabu, jilipwagi mmoju waki, “Sakaka mundu joanhagwi Bambu Sapanga kumpaki mahuta ndi jonzo jojubii palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga!” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Wiilingali sula jaki nu ulasu waki. Nepani nunkaniki ndaba ngaseningalii ngati bandu ealinga, ndaba bandu alingali sa kunza ila nepani Sapanga ningalii mmwoju.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ndienu, Yese ankema Abinadabu nukundeta palongi jaka Samweli. Lakini Samweli jaapwaga, “Bambu Sapanga ngaseahangwi hojo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese anndeta Shama, Samweli japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga ngaseahangwi hojo kabee.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese jaaleta bana baki boti saba palongi jaka Samweli lakini Samweli ampwagila, “Bambu Sapanga ngaseahangwi jokapi kati ja haba.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Kabee ampwagila, “Boo, haba ndi bana baku boti bagubii nako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Yese jajibua, “Jwakona nsoku jumu, lakini jupiti kukulima makondoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Samweli ampwagila, “Ntuma mundu anndeta, twepani ngatutami pai, mbaka pajiika pamba.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Ndienu, Yese antuma mundu najombi andeta. Nkombu jola jabii jojubii na yega, jojubii na miu gaganang'ana nagagalenganii. Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Samweli, “Ndi jojo jumuka gumpakiya mahuta.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Samweli jajukua linyelu laki lelibii na mahuta gi mizeituni nukunzakanii Daudi mahuta palongi ja alongu mundu. Apalapa loho jaka Bambu Sapanga junhikila Daudi kwa makili nukutama nkati jaki, kutumbuli lisoba leheli nu kuendale. Ndienu Samweli jabuja ku musi uku Lama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi juhenga lihengu kwaka Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Mwenikatai Loho jaka Bambu Sapanga jummboka Sauli na loho jiliya jejilekawi na Bambu Sapanga jatenda kunsumbuu. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Ndienu, atumisi baka Sauli bumpwagila, “Tumanyiki kubanga loho jiliya jejilekakiwi na Sapanga jitenda kugusumbuu. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Henu wa bambu witu, walagalakiya atumisi baku babugutumaki buntaputa mundu jojubii nu jojumanyiki kuona kilimba, na loho jiliya heji kuhuma kwaka Bambu Sapanga pajaguhikila, mundu hoju jiipega kilimba, na wehapa wiitenda kupogale.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Sauli jaapwagila atumisi baki, “Ndaputiya mundu hoju jojuwesa kuhona kilimba sapi nnetila.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Nkombu jumu kati ja atumisi jaapwaga, “Numbweni nkombu jumu jwaka Yese, jwa musi uku Betileemu. Nkombu we hoju jubii nu jumanyi kuhona kilimba. Kabee ndi jubii nganganganga kukomana, jumanyi kulonge sapi nu jubii ni liumbu la sapi, na Bambu Sapanga jubii pamu najombi.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ndienu, Sauli jaatuma bandu kwaka Yese nu kupwaaga, “Ndumila mwana waku Daudi jojilima makondoo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese antuma Daudi kwaka Sauli pamu na maponda gaki gagatotwi mabumunda ni kipuku sa ngosi seabekiki divai na kapongu kimbui ili ampelakiya Daudi ngati nhupi. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daudi pajahika jajingala kuntumaki Sauli. Sauli ampai ngamaa, mbaka anhenga jubia jojutoto hindu yukukomane ngondu. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Kabee Sauli jaatuma bandu bukumpwagila Yese, “Numpai ngamaa Daudi gunndeka jutama pamba jundumakiya.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Kila loho mbaja jela ejikubika junhiki Sauli nukunsumbuu, Daudi jujukua kilimba nukutumbuli kuhona, na loho jiliya junndeka Sauli, najombi Sauli jilijoane sapi nukupogale.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Goliati jukomana na Aizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Ndienu Apilisti baakusanya alonda babu ku Soku, musi gogubi ku Yuda, tayali kukukomana. Babeka kambi pandu pamu pabapakema ku Epesu Damimu pikilanda ja Soku nuku Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli pamu na Aizilaeli bakusanyika, nu kupega kambi mu ligomba la Ela. Bilipanga kukomana na Apilisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Apilisti bajema pikitombi upandi gumu na Aizilaeli bajema pikitombi upandi gongi, pikilanda jabu kwabii ni ligomba.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kuhuma mu likambi la Apilisti, japitila mundu jumu jobunkema Goliati jojubii nganganganga, mwenei jwa musi wa Gati. Ulasu waki wabiya guhegale kuba mita itatu. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Kumutu jawati kopia ja shaba, na dilii ja shaba jukulikengale mikoa pikigamba jejibii na kilu hamsini na sita. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Magolu gaki kabee gakabii na hindu yukulikenga ya shaba, mumabega gaki jatotwi nkoa wa shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Mpini gu nkoa waki wakabii ngati mpengu goaloke, ni kimutu sunkoa waki sabia kilu saba. Ingau jaki jatotwi mundu jongi jojabii julonguli. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliati jajema na kwaapege keleli alonda buku Izilaeli, japwaaga, “Nhenga kyani pamba? Boo nhikiki kukomana ngondo? Nepani nu Mpilisti, mwanganya ndi mwaatumwa baka Sauli. Nhagula mundu jumu juhika kukomana na nepani. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Junhwesa nu kungoma, twepani twiibiya twaatumwa binu. Lakini ananunhwesiki nu kunkoma, mwanganya mwibiya mwaatumwa bitu.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Ndienu Mpilisti hoju jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Naapala alonda buku Izilaeli lisoba lende kumpia mundu jumu juhika kukomana na nepani.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli pamu na alonda boti buku Izilaeli pabajoa malobi haga kuhuma kwa Apilisti, bahangajiki ngamaa nu kujogopa ngamaa.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi mwi likambi laka Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daudi jabiya mwana waka Yese, mundu juku Efulati kuhuma ku Betileemu nndema uku Yuda. Yese jabiya na bana nani akanalomi. Kipindi Sauli pajabii bambu nkolongu, Yese jabii nseja, mundu jojubii na yaka hingi. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Bana akolongu atatu baka Yese, Eliabu kibeleku su utumbuli na Abinadabu jojapwata Shama jwa tatu, babiya apiti pamu na Sauli kukomana. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daudi ndi jojabii nsoku jwa boti. Bana boti atatu akolongu babiya apiti pamu na Sauli kukomana. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Hata ngati Daudi pukutumbuli jabia jujenda kipindi soti kwaka Sauli, jakelubuka kunyumba ku Betileemu kulima makondoo ga atati baki.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa masoba alubaini, pulukela na pakamii, Mpilisti Goliati japitila pakwendu, jujemika na kwaalongama alonda buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Lisoba limu Yese ampwagila Daudi, “Apelakiya akaalongu baku mandotu kilu komi na mabumunda komi. Waapelakiya nnyata ku likambi. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Nu nndonda waki nkolongu ji kikundi sa alonda elupu mpelakiya ipandi komi ya mahuta ga masiba gagandiki gabagakema jibiini. Wakaalinga akalongu baku aendalee boo na henu winetila majambu gabu.” <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Kipindi sehesi bambu nkolongu Sauli, akaalongu baka Daudi na alonda boti buku Izilaeli babiya abii ku ligomba luku Ela, akomana ngondu na Apilisti.<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Kilabu jaki Daudi jajumuka lukela ngani jagaleka makondoo anndekila jojulima. Jajukua posu nu kujenda ngati atati baki Yese ebabiya bunndagalaki. Ejabia mu likambi la Aizilaeli, jaaketaninya atenda kulipanga pandu pabu pukukomana babiya ajemba miambu jukugangamalisana mioju kukukomana. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Alonda buku Izilaeli na alonda ba Apilisti bilipangiki kukomana ngondu, alonda babiya ahegalane ili kukomana. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi ankabisa posu mundu jojutunza misigu, jaabutukiya alonda, nukujenda kwaalamuki akaalongu mundu. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Ejabiya julongee nabu, Goliati Mpilisti jojubii nganganganga kuhuma ku Gati japitila palongi ja alonda buku Izilaeli ngati ejayobali. Najombi Daudi anzoanaki sapi ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Aizilaeli pabummbona Goliati batenda kutila nukujogopa ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Bapwaganinya, “Boo, bumbweni mundu jola jojapitalile? Kyee sakaka jupiti kwaalongama Aizilaeli. Bambu nkolongu Sauli ampekiya mali gingi mundu jokapi joakoma mundu hajo. Kupeta goti haga antogulisa kamwali waki jubiya nhwana mundu. Kabee, bandu ba atati baki bibiya alekakiwi na ngabiilepi kode.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daudi jaalalukiya bandu bababii pambipi nabu, “Boo, mundu joankoma Mpilisti hajo nukujikomboo Izilaeli kulengana ni iyoni haye banhengila kyane? Nya Mpilisti hoju jwanga kusekuliwa jandu juwesa boo kwaatondo alonda baka Sapanga jojubii mwome?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Bandu bumpwagila ana eapwagiki pu utumbuli kupete mundu joankoma Goliati.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Lakini Eliabu kaka nkolongu waka Daudi pajajoa Daudi jakalongila na bandu, anyomila Daudi nu kupwaaga, “Ndaba jakii kuhika kongone? Boo, makondoo masokopi gala gunndeki nyanye ku lukoba kola? Manyiki wehapa gubii ni ing'omu nugunzanza. Guhiki pe kulingali ngondu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daudi jajibua, “Henu nndei kike? Boo ngasembalika lee hata kulaluki pena?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Daudi anng'anambukiya mundu jongi nukunndaluki kabee lijambu alela, na kila joanndalukiya japata lijibu alelale.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Bandu bangi babunzoa Daudi ejaapwaaga, bajenda kumpwagi Sauli. Najombi Sauli jaalagalakiya bunkema. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daudi ampwagila Sauli, “Mundu jokapi jwihangajika mmwoju jaki kupete Mpilisti hajo. Nepani ntumisi waku ngiti nyenda kukomana naku.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli ampwagila Daudi, “Wehapa ngaguwesi kujenda kukomana naku Mpilisti jolajola. Wehapa gu nkombu unsoku pena, lakini mundu hajo jubii mu kukomana ngondu tumbuka pu ukombu waki.”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Daudi ampwagila Sauli, “Nepani ntumisi waku nyobali kulima makondoo ga atati bangu. Kila lihimba au kinyama sebikikema dubu ejihika kukamuu makondoo, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />nepani nilikagula nukukomana naku, nukulioko likondoo mu nndomu jaki. Ana lihimba au kinyama sebikikema dubu analipala kungoma nepani ngamula nhingu jaki, nukulihabu pai nu kulikoma. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Nepani ntumisi waku ngomiki mahimba gingipi ni kinyama sakikema dubu hingipi. Henu hata mpilisti jwanga kunseku jandu hajo, jojuwe jaalongama alonda baka Sapanga jojubii mwomi, jibiya ngati haba. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Bambu Sapanga jojunhokwi muyobu ya mahimba na dubu, jiinhokua kuhuma kuku Npilisti hajo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Sauli ampwagila, “Jenda najombi Bambu Sapanga jubiya pamu na wehapa.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sauli anhwatika Daudi ingobu yaki yukukomane, anhwatika na kopia jaki ja shaba kumutu ni likoti laki lukuyekale pi kigamba. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daudi jabopula upanga waka Sauli, jalenga kujenda, lakini jatenda kusindwa ndaba ngasejiiyobali ingobu ngati heyi. Ampwagila Sauli, “Nganhwesi kujenda kukomana koni nhweti ingobu yenze, ndaba nepani ngaseniiyobali.” Ndienu jatenda kuhula. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Daudi jajukua ndonga jaki mukuboku, jahagula malibu nhwanu ga sapi kuhuma mu kalosi, jagajegala mukapuku kaki kukulimi. Kombeo jaki mu kuboku jaki, jatumbuliya kunzende Goliati mundu juku Filisti.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi anhwesa Goliati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Mpilisti jola jatumbuliya kunzende Daudi, na jombi jojutoto ingau jaki jubii palongi jaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Mpilisti jola pajalinga nu kunndingalii sapi Daudi, jatenda kunndongama, ndaba Daudi jabiya nkombu pena, jojubii na yega ja sapi na jojunyambiki. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliati anndalukiya Daudi, “Henu nndonga heji ndi ja kike? Guholale nepani ndi jimbwa mbaka kunhiki na nndonga?” Nplisti hoju anndapila Daudi kwaka isapanga yaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Npilisti ampwagila Daudi, “Nhika kwangu! Yega jaku naipekiya ijuni yu nnani ni inyama yu mukioli!”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Lakini Daudi ampwagila Goliati, “Wehapa gunhiki nepani ku upanga nu nkoa na simi. Lakini nepani nuguhiki wehapa ku uwesu waka Bambu Sapanga jwa alonda. Sapanga jwa alonda buku Izilaeli, jojuwe wehapa watenda kuntondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Lisoba la lelenu, Bambu Sapanga ngiti junyangatiya nuguwesa. Nagulekala pai, nagusekula kimutu saku, na yega ya alonda ba Apilisti naapekiya ijuni yu nnani ni inyama imwikioli. Ndienu nndema gwoti pagwiimanya jubii Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Bandu boti babakusanyiki pamba lelenu, biimanya ana Bambu Sapanga ngasejupalika kuba ni mikoa wala simi ili kwaokoa bandu. Heji ndi ngondu jaka Bambu Sapanga, najombi jaanhenga mwanganya mwaawesa.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliati jatumbuliya kabee kunzendee Daudi. Daudi jabutuka imbelu kujenda mu nstali gukukomana ngondu ili kulapula. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Jajingia kuboku kwaki mu mpuku waki, japia lilibu limu jalekala kombeu jaki, anndapula Goliati pamiu jaki, lilibu lajendula pamiu jaka Goliati nu kukaju kimutu. Goliati jahabuka pai sumunyuma. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Ndienu Daudi eanhwesa Goliati ku likombeu laki ni lilibu. Anndapula Npilisti jola nu kunkoma. Daudi ngasejabii nu upanga wokapi mu kuboku jaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Ndienu Daudi, jajombatika imbelu jajema panani jaka Goliati, jaholumula upanga waka Goliati gowabi mu nhaku waki, ankoma Goliati sukunseku umutu waki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Apilisti pababona nkolongu wabu bunkomiki, batilaninya imbelu. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Ndienu, bandu buku Izilaeli na bandu buku Yuda pabatumbuliya kupega keleli yu kuwesa, baapwataliya Apilisti mbaka ku Gati, mu nndayangu uku Ekiloni hata Apilisti babaalimingi ku ngondu baenii ngamaa tumbuka mwiindela ku Shaalimu mbaka ku Gati nuku Ekiloni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Aizilaeli pabapita kwaapwatali Apilisti, banyaga kila sindu sesabii mu likambi labu. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi jajukua kimutu saka Goliati, Npilisti jikipelika ku musi uku Yelusalemu. Lakini hindu yukukomane yaka Goliati jiibeka mu lihema laki.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi ampeleka kwaka Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli paammbona Daudi jujenda kukomana nu Npilisti Goliati, anndalukiya Abineli, nndonda nkolongu jwa alonda baki, “Abineli, hajo mwana waka nyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abineli jajibua, “Bambu nkolongu ngati egutama nepani ngakumanya.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Bambu nkolongu Sauli anndalukiya, “Henu lalukiya jonioju we mwana waka nyanye.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Apalapa Daudi pajakelubuka baada jukunkoma Goliati, Abineli anzukua nukumpeleka kwaka Sauli. Kipindi sehesi Daudi jabiya jakona jutotwi kimutu saka Goliati mu kuboku jaki. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauli anndalukiya Daudi, “Nkombu, wehapa wa mwana waka nyanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Daudi jajibua, “Nepani mwana waka ntumisi Yese, kuhuma ku musi uku Betileemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Sauli pajajomula kulonge na Daudi, Yonasani mwana waka Sauli ampai ngamaa Daudi, ampai kwa mwoju waki gwoa ngati ejilipai mweni. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kutumbuli lisoba heli, Sauli anzukua Daudi kujenda nnyumba jaki, na ngaseanzetaki kukelabuka kunyumba ja atati baki. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Ndaba Yonasani ampai ngamaa Daudi ngati ejilipai mweni, jahenga naku malaganu, <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonasani jahula ingobu yejaweti kumpeke Daudi na hindu yaki yukukomane, hata upanga nu lupendi nu nkanda waki. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Kwokapi Sauli koantuma Daudi, Daudi lihengu lokapi lebuntuma kuhenga jahenga sapi. Ndienu Sauli anhenga kuba kilongosi wa alonda baki. Lijambu heli laahenga bandu atoguliya mbaka atumisi baka Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli ammbone wipu Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Alonda pababiya atenda kubuja kunyumba, pamu na Daudi baada jukunkoma Npilisti, akammbomba kuhuma kila musi guku Izilaeli bapita kujenda kunzopa bambu nkolongu Sauli. Akammbomba behaba babiya ajemba miambu jukutogule, koni ajemba imbelakete ni ilimba. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Kabee babiya ahina nu kujemba miambu nukupengana ana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">“Sauli jukomiki maelupu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 18:7">na Daudi jukomiki makomi elupu.” <verse eid="1SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Sauli ngasejalenganiwi na malobi gu nhwambu hogu, ndienu jayomiki ngamaa. Kupwaaga, “Ampeki Daudi makomi elupu, lakini nepani ammbeki maelupu pena. Sekihigalii ngiti ampekiya Daudi ubambu nkolongu.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kutumbulii lisoba heli, Sauli jabiya ammbone wipu Daudi nukunndingali sa pambipi.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Kilabu jaki, loho ji kihakau jejalekakiwi na Sapanga, apalapa junzingala Sauli, jabiya julopoka ngati mwana mangongu kunyumba jaki. Daudi jabiya juhona kilimba ngati ejabiya juhenga masoba goti. Sauli jabiya nu nkoa mu kuboku jaki, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />ndienu, anhomila Daudi nkoa mala pabeli jabiya juwasali ana, “Nammbana Daudi mu lumatu.” Lakini Daudi jatenda kujepa mala yoti ibeli.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli jabiya anzogopa Daudi ndaba Bambu Sapanga jabii pamu najombi, lakini Bambu Sapanga jabiya anndei Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ndienu Sauli ammboa Daudi kunyumba jaki nu unhenga jubiya kilongosi jwa alonda elupu jimu, najombi Daudi jaalongusa sapi mu kukomana. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Kila sindu sejahenga Daudi jahenga sapi, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jabii pamu najombi. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli pajalinga Daudi jutenda kuwesa kila sindu, jaaendaliya kunnzogopa nakanopi. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Lakini Bandu boti buku Izilaeli na Yuda bumpai ngamaa Daudi, ndaba jaalongusa sapi mu kukomana na kwaakelabuu sukuwesa.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi anzukuu kamwali waka Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli ampwagila Daudi, “Hajo ndi Melabu kamwali wangu nkolongu, nugupeke jubiya nhwanu waku ku mihilu haje. Gubiya gu nndonda wangu wogubii nganganganga na gogujoane, gukomana ngondu yaka Bambu Sapanga.” Sauli jabiya juholale ana kwi indela heji Apilisti baankoma Daudi, ili lihengu heli jalihenga mweni.<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daudi ampwagila Sauli, “Nepani na nya hata bambu nkolongu jubia nkoanu wangu? Bandu bu lukolu lwangu ndi akanyane na hata bandu bu nyumba ja atati bangu ngaseamanyikana pa Izilaeli pani.” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Ndienu pasahika kipindi saka Daudi bumpekiya Melabu, ndienu Melabu kamwali waka Sauli buntogulisa kwaka mundu jongi jobunkema Adilei juku musi uku Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Hata hela, Mikali kamwali jongi waka Sauli ampai Daudi. Sauli eampwagila jatogulii ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli jaholaliya, “Lenda numpekiya hajo ili jubiya ntegu kwaki.” Ndienu Sauli ampwagila Daudi mala ja pili, “Henu ngiti miya nu nkoanu waku.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Ndienu Sauli jaalagalakiya atumisi baki kupwaaga, “Longila kwa sili na Daudi kumpwaagi, ‘Bambu nkolongu gunndengani ngamaa, hata atumisi baki boti kabee bugupai.’ Ndienu jetakiya kuba gunkoanu wake.”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Ndienu, atumisi baka Sauli bumpwagila Daudi malobi haga kwa sili, najombi jaapwagila, “Nepani na mundu nhagu ngamaa. Boo gunholale bambu nkolongu ndi juwesa kuba nkoanu wango leniheli le ndi lijambu lelijojwike?”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Atumisi bala bunndandila Sauli ngati Daudi ejupwagiki. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli jaapwagila, “Mumpwagila Daudi ana, ‘Sejupala bambu nkolongu gupia ngati mali ili gunzukua kamwali waki ndi gumpekiya ngosi yukuseku jandu mia jimu yeyuye yewaasekula Apilisti, ili alepisa kisasi sa abaja baki.’” Hela ndi Sauli ejapanga kunkoma Apilisti. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Atumisi bala babunndandila Daudi gajupala Sauli, Daudi jatogulii ngamaa kuba nkoanu waka bambu nkolongu. Kabula ji lisoba la ndoa, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daudi na bandu baki bajenda, kwaakoma Apilisti mia mbili nukujuku ngosi yukuseku jandu mbaka kwaka bambu nkolongu Sauli. Hapa bummbalangiya idadi joti ili bambu nkolongu jubia nkoanu waki Daudi. Ndienu Sauli ampekiya Daudi kamwali waki Mikali jubiya nhwanu waki.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Lakini Sauli pajabona ana Bambu Sapanga jubii pamu na Daudi, na kamwali waki Mikali ampai ngamaa Daudi, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sauli jaendaliya kunzogopa Daudi. Sauli jabiya mbaja waka Daudi masoba goti gukutama kwaki.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Alonda ba Apilisti bajenda kukomana ngondu na Aizilaeli, lakini kila ebakomana ngondu, Daudi jabiya jutenda kuwesa kupeta atumisi baka Sauli, ndienu liina laka Daudi jaendaliya kumanyikana nakanopi.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli julenga kunkoma Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli anndandila mwana waki Yonasani na akakilongosi baki kupete mpangu waki ukunkoma Daudi. Lakini Yonasani, mwana waka Sauli, ampai ngamaa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Ndienu ampwagila, “Atati bangu apangi kugukoma. Ndienu gujepana. Kilabu pulukela, wiijoba pandu pu ujobu, gwitama papu. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nepani nihika nu kujema pambipi na atati bangu ku litui pandu pawiikuba. Papuje nagulongaliya wehapa, nasindu sokapi seniigundua kuhuma kwabu, niitenda kugulandi.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonasani anndumbali Daudi palongi ja atati baki, ampwagila, “Wanhenge majambu giliya ntumisi waku Daudi ndaba jombi ngasejuguhengi majambu giliya gokapi wehapa, mahengu gaki goti gajuguhengi gabia gaamboni kwaku. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Paankoma Npilisti Goliati, ngasejajogupa kuwa, najombi Bambu Sapanga jaapekia Aizilaeli kuwesa kukolongu. Wehapa paulibona lijambu heli watogulii ngamaa. Ndaba jakii guhenga majambu giliya kwaka mundu jwanga na makosa ngati Daudi sukupala kunkoma sanga makosa?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli annzoaninya Yonasani ndienu jaalapa, “Naapa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, nganaakomi Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Ndienu, Yonasani ankema Daudi nu kunndandi majambu haga goti. Yonasani ampelika Daudi kwaka Sauli, na Daudi akuntumakiya bambu nkolongu Sauli ngati pu utumbulii.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Mwenikatai kwabiya na ngondu kabee kati ja Apilisti na Azilaeli. Daudi japita kukomana na Apilisti, jaakoma Apilisti bingi na babahigali batenda kuntila.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Ndienu, loho jiliya jejilekakiwi na Bambu Sapanga junhikila Sauli pajabiya jutami nnyumba jaki jabiya jukamwi mkoa mukuboku, kipindi sesuse Daudi pajabiya juhona kilimba. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli pajalenga kunhosa Daudi ku nkoa hogu, lakini Daudi jatenda kugujepa nkoa waka Sauli nu nkoa watonga mulumatu. Ikilu jela Daudi jatila ili kulilamisa.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Ikilu jela Sauli jaatuma alonda kwaka Daudi bikijilonda nyumba ili ana jubii juwesa kunkoma pulukela. Lakini Mikali, nhwanu waka Daudi ampwagila jutila, “Ana ngasekutiliki kulamisa womi waku ikilu jenu biitenda kugukoma.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Ndienu, Mikali ampia Daudi kupeta pilindilisa, najombi jaapita nu kutila. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikali jajukua kimong'umong'u, jikigonika pikitanda nukukiyekale ingobu, jabeka ntou wa mangoma gi imbui pamutu ji kimong'umong'u hesi. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sauli paajatuma bandu kunkamu Daudi, Mikali jaapwagila Daudi we nngonzu. <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Ndienu Sauli jaatuma akelubuka kabee koku, jaalagalakiya kupwaaga, “Mundeta kwangu Daudi panani ji kitanda nunnkoma.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Bandu bala pabajingala munyumba jaka Daudi nukukilingali kitanda babona kibii kimong'umong'u nu ntou wa mangoma gi imbui kumutu. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Ndienu Sauli anndalukiya Mikali ndaba jakii gutei kungonga? “Gundei mbaja wangu jutilaje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Najombi Mikali annzibua Sauli jandisila kungoma, “Jambwaagila, ‘Neka nyenda nhwesa kugukoma.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Daudi pajatila, jajenda ku Lama kwaka Samweli. Anndandila Samweli majambu goti gajabiya anhengi Sauli. Ndienu, Daudi na Samweli bajenda nu kutama ku musi uku Nayoti. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Mwenikatai mundu jumu ampwagila Sauli kubanga Daudi jubii ku musi uku Nayoti ku Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Ndipapuje pajaapelika bandu bunkukamula. Lakini biliketaninya likundi la alota lakalondula na Samweli koni jililongosa, loho jaka Sapanga jaahikila atumisi baka Sauli nabombi kabee batumbuliya kulondo. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli pabumpwagila majambu haga, jaatuma atumisi bangi, nabombi kabee batumbuliya kulondo. Sauli pajaatuma atumisi bangi kwa mala ja tatu, nabombi kabee batumbuliya kulondo. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Ndipala mweni jajenda ku Lama. Pajahika ku kiliba kikolongu sekibii ku Seku, anketaninya mundu jumu jojuwe anndalukiya, “Samweli na Daudi abii kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Mundu we hoju anzibua, “Abii ku musi uku Nayoti ku Lama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Najombi Sauli jajenda ku musi uku Nayoti ku Lama. Pajahika hoku loho jaka Sapanga junhikila, najombi jatumbuliya kulondoo jubii mwiindela mbaka pajahika ku musi uku Nayoti ku Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Jahula ingobu yaki jabiya julondoo palongi jaka Samweli. Jahigaliya heu kwi lisoba limu, ikilu na mui. Ndienu bandu batumbuliya kulilaluki, “Boo, Sauli najombi kabee jabiya jumu jwa alota?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani anzangati Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Ndienu, Daudi jatila kuhuma ku musi uku Nayoti ku Lama, jajenda mbaka kwaka Yonasani, ampwagila, “Nhengiki kike? Boo, likosa langu nepani kike? Naahengi atati baku kihakau bole mbaka apala kungoma?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonasani jajibua, “Ngaela! Ngagukuwe! Linga, atati banguambwagi hindu yoti yeahenga kikubi sindu sokapi kikolongu au kisoku. Ndaba jakii anhiya alele? Ngaela ekwiibiya jene.”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Lakini Daudi jalapa kupwaga, “Sakaka atati baku amanyiki sapi pena egummbai, na aholale kuguhiya lijambu leheli ili wiiyoma pabalihenga. Lakini, kwa namuna jokapi jela napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, na wehapa egubii wa mwomi, ndaba nepani nhegali kuwa.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonasani ampwagila Daudi, “Sokapi sewakipala nhenga ngiti ndenda kuguhenge.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Daudi ampwagila, “Kilabu ndi tipati ja mwei kupita, nanepani kupalika kuba pamesa kula pamu na bambu nkolongu. Lakini neka, nakajoba ku litui mbaka pamalabu pakamii. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Atati baku ebakalinga ngasemii pakula posu, anabugulaluki majambu gangu, ndienu wakaapwagila, ‘Daudi junobiki ngamaa nunnzetakaliya jujenda ku musi jaki ku Betileemu, jakabiya mu matambiku ga kila saka pamu na alongu baki.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Ana gulibweni hale ndi laamboni, ndienu gumanya lijambu laki panani jangu ndi liliya. Ana ngahela ndi wiimanya mpangu waki kwangu nepani ndi guliya. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ndienu guhengila ikia yaku ndaba guhengiki Lilaganu na Bambu Sapanga. Nanepani ntumisi waku, palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. Lakini ana nhengiki likosa henu gungoma wehapa wamweti, ila wiimbeleka kwa atati baku anngoma.”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonasani jaapwaaga, “Kotuka kuholale hela! Lakini anakwakabii ambwagi sindu sokapi atati bangu apala kugukoma wehapa, boo, nganukugupwagile?”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Daudi jalalukiya, “Kwibiya boo, ana atati baku bibiya bugupwagi su ukale?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonasani annzibua, “Nhika tujenda ku litui!” Ndienu, batenda kujendane. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonasani ampwagila Daudi, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Izilaeli, nu jubiya mundu jojulingali nu kujoane. Kilabu au pamalabu, kipindi ngati senze naalalukiya atati bangu. Ana jagulongaliya malobi ga sapi niitenda kugupwagila. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Lakini ana atati bangu apala kugukoma na nepani ngasenugupwagi ili gujenda pandu patali pawibiya wa mwome, nala Bambu Sapanga jungoma. Bambu Sapanga nu jubiya pamu na wehapa ngati ejabiya pamu na atati bangu.” <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ana niendaliya kuba na mwomi ndienu winangia upali wa sakaka waka Bambu Sapanga lakini ana nguwiki, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />kabee wikotoka kwaatende uamboni akaalongu bangu sukuhobaleka masoba goti ganga na mwisu. Hata Bambu Sapanga pajaakoma tipitipi abaja baku kuhuma ku nndema, <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />ndienu Yonasani jahenga lilaganu na nyumba jaka Daudi jaapwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jaakoma aka abaja baku.”<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Ndipala, Yonasani ampwagila Daudi julapa kulengana nu upali waki jombi Yonasani, ndaba ampai ngati ejilipala mweni. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Ndienu ampwagila Daudi, “Ndaba kilabu ndi tipati jukubonikana mwei, bandu biibona hotuhotu kubanga gubii, ndaba kiteu saku sibiya pangwendu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Kabee pamalabu bandu bagukosa ngani. Lisoba le eli jenda pandu papuje wajoba kipindi lijambu lende palabii lakona, wakajoba pambipi ji lilibu luku Ezeli. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nepani niihoma misali mitatu pulutengu ngati nikihoma sindu sengi. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Ndienu, naantuma ntumisi wangu jujenda kutaputa misali heji. Ngati ananumpwagi, ‘Linga misali haje jibii upandi waku hogu wajijukua,’ hoku kwibiya kulangi kubanga gubii wa mwomi, nanagu wiipitila kuhuma pandu pagujobiki, ndaba napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, kubanga wibiya wa mwomi sanga kujogopa sokapi. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Lakini ananumpwaagi, ‘Linga mikoa jibii palongi jaku,’ hapa wiiboka, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jiibiya jupala kujenda kutali. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kulengana na malagi gatubekanii, Bambu Sapanga jibiya ndi jojagabweni na jojajoini nukutuhenga twiijewa masoba goti ganga na mwisu.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Ndienu, Daudi jajoba mu litui. Kipindi sa matola gukubonikana mwei, bambu nkolongu Sauli jatama pamesa kula. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Ngati ebayobali, bambu nkolongu jutama pi kiteu saki sekibii pambipi pu lumatu. Yonasani jatama sukulingalani na bambu nkolongu na Abineli jatama pambipi na bambu nkolongu. Lakini pandu paka Daudi pajabiya jutama nganamundu. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Lisoba heli Sauli ngasejapwaga lijambu lokapi, ndaba jaholaliya kubanga kwa pangi Daudi sumpatiki sindu sensunhenga jiijetakeka kunndumbali Sapanga au pengi sunhengiki jiihika mu matola haga. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Lisoba la pili, baada jukupeta matola jukubonikana mwei, kabee pandu paka Daudi pabiya kabe nganamundu. Sauli anndalukiya mwana waki Yonasani. “Ndaba jakii Daudi mwana waka Yese, ngasejahiki kula posu, lisu na lelenu?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonasani annzibua Sauli, “Janobiki ngamaa nyetakaliya jujenda ku Betilehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Jambwagila, ‘Nyetakaliya kwa alongu bangu ndaba ahenga lihengu lukupia litambiku ku musi, nu nndongu wangu jupai mia. Ana gunyetakali nyenda kwa alongu bangu.’ Ndienu mana ngasejubii pa kula posu na twepani saka bambu nkolongu.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Papuje Sauli jabiya ni inyela kupete kwaka Yonasani, ampwagila, “Mwana waka mmbomba juliya na jojubii ni kihakau wehapa! Manyiki ana gunhangwi mwana waka Yese kwi iyoni yaku wamwete, na kwaapoa iyoni anyongo baku! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Boo, ngasegumanyiki ana Daudi pajibiya mwomi, wehapa ngawiwesi kupata napwasi ja kuba wa bambu nkolongu wu nndema gongo? Ndienu jenda gukunndeta kwangu, ndaba kupalika jukomika.”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonasani jaalalukiya, “Ndaba jaki gupala kunkoma? Juhengiki kike?”<verse eid="1SA 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Lakini Sauli apalapa anndekaliya Yonasani nkoa ili ankoma. Najombi Yonasani jamanya kubanga atati baki babiya apangi kunkoma Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Papuje Yonasani, koni juyomiki ngamaa, jaboka pa mesa nnyata, wala ngasejakula posu jokapi lisoba la pili heli la matola gukubonikana mwei. Yonasani jayomiki ngamaa ndaba atati baki babiya atondwi ndaba ja majambu gaka Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Pulukela jaki, Yonasani jajenda ku litui, kuketangana na Daudi ngati ebatabukana. Jajenda hoku nu nkombu jumu mwanalomi. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Pajahika ampwagila nkombu waki, “Butuka wakataputa misali jenakahoma.” Nkombu jola pajabiya jutenda kubutuka, Yonasani jahoma misali palongi jaki. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Nkombu jola pajahika pandu misali pajihabuki, Yonasani ankema, “Nsali gubii palongi jaku. <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Henga nnyata na wiijema pandu hapa pena.” Nkombu jola jakusanya misali joti nukujenda kwaka bambu waki. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Lakini nkombu jola ngasejamanyiki sokapi kupete lihengu lelela. Babamanyiki ndi Yonasani na Daudi pena. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonasani ankabisa nkombu jola hindu yukukomane nukumpwagi, “Jenda ku musi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Apalapa nkombu jola ejabiya juboi. Daudi jajumuka nu kuboka pandu pajajobiki pambipi ni lilundu la malibu. Jajinama pai kwi isima mala patatu palongi jaka Yonasani. Boti abeli, Daudi na Yonasani, batenda kujobatane nu kulela. Daudi jalela nakanopi kupeta Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Ndienu Yonasani ampwagila Daudi, “Jenda ku lukwali. Tulapiki twaboti ku liina laka Bambu Sapanga, kuba Bambu Sapanga jubiya jojagabweni nukugajoana majambu kati jitu masoba goti ganga na mwisu, na kati ji ibeleku yangu masoba goti ganga na mwisu.” Daudi jajumuka nu kujenda kwaki, najombi Yonasani jakelubuka ku musi.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Daudi antila Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Daudi jajenda kuku nngolu Ahimeleki ku Nobu. Ahimeleki japita kujenda kunzopa koni jakabagaja, anndalukiya, “Ndaba jaki guhikiki kajika jako?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daudi anzibua, “Mii pamba kulengana na mihilu jaka bambu nkolongu. Jambwagila nampwagi mundu kupete sejundumi. Naganii na bandu bangu kubanga tuketangana pandu pamba. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Boo, gubii na sindu sokapi sa kula? Nuguloba mabumunda nhwanu au sokapi sekibii.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Nngolu Ahimeleki anzibua, “Pamba ngasemii na mabumunda gaugamanyiki. Mii pe na mabumunda gaapiiki kwaka Bambu Sapanga. Nhwesa kupata mabumunda haga ana bandu baku ngaseagoni na akammbomba pambipi.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daudi ampwagila, “Sakaka, panijenda kuhenga mahengu ga kila lisoba gu ulonda, ngasetugone na akammbomba! Ana akakombu bangu ajetakeka kunndumbali Sapanga eakuba mu mahengu ga kila lisoba, boo, nga lee nakanopi mu mahengu makolongo ngati aga gajututumiki bambu nkolongo?”<verse eid="1SA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Ndienu, nngolu Ahimeleki ampekiya mabumunda gaapiiki kwaka Sapanga, ndaba ngasejabii na mabumunda gangi kupeta haga lakini gajubei palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, bang'anambua mabumunda manyai gabahuma kujoko pikihinza.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Ndienu, lisoba heli jabiya ntumisi jumu waka Sauli jojuwe jabiya hapa ndaba jukumpiki matambiku Bambu Sapanga. Ntumisi hoju ankema Doegi, mundu juku Edomu jojujemale alimi baka Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Ndienu, Daudi ampwagila nngolu Ahimeleki, “Boo, gubii nu upanga nu nkoa goguwe guwesa kumbekea? Ndaba mahengu gaka bambu nkolongu kupalika moka kanyata, nanepani naboka sanga upanga wangu wala hindu yukukomane yokapi.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ahimeleki anzibua, “Mii nu upanga wa Apilisti Goliati joankomiki ku ligomba la Ela, gubii mu nyuma jiki kizibau saka nngolu jukongiki mu kitambaa. Ana gupai kujukuu hogu ndienu, gujukua ndaba nga upanga gongi pamba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Daudi ampwagila, “Ngakuba upanga gongi wa sapi ngati hogu, nuguloba gumbekiya.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Lisoba heli, Daudi antila Sauli, jajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu Akishi juku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Atumisi baka bambu nkolongu bumpwagila Akishi, “Boo, jonioju lee nga Daudi bambu nkolongu ju nndema wake? Boo, jonioju lee ngajobunzemba nukuhone ing'oma kupwaaga, ‘Sauli jukomiki maelupu gaki na Daudi jukomiki makomi elupu gaki?’ ”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daudi jabiya jutenda kugakomboka ndienu jatumbuliya kunzogopa ngamaa Akishi bambu nkolongu juku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Ndienu, jang'anambua tabia jaki, jilihenga mwana mangongu, jabiya jukwandakwanda mu milyangu ja musi ni imata gaki jagaleka ganyika mwi indeu yaki.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi jaampwagila atumisi baki, “Mmanyiki kuba mundu hajo ndi mwanamangongu, ndaba jakii mundetiki kwango? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Boo, nelee naapai ngani akanamangongo? Ndaba jakii nnete mwanamangongu juhika kunzumbuu na mahengu gasanamangongo? Boo mundu we hoju kupalika juhika kunyumba jango?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Sauli jaakoma akaagolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daudi jaboka ku Gati jatilila mu likolu pambipi na musi wa Adulamu. Aka abeli baki na alongu baki bangi pabajoa ana jubii hapa, boti bajenda kujongana naku. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Bandu boti babalimbalakiya au babaii na madeni, au bababia ngaseagupai ulongosi waka Sauli babiya pamu na Daudi. Jumula boti babiya bandu mia nsesi, najombi jabiya kilongosi wabu.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kuhuma hoku, Daudi jajenda mbaka ku Mizipa nndema uku Moabu. “Ampwagila Bambu nkolongu juku Moabu, waaloba atati bangu na anyongo bangu atama pamba kwaku mbaka pannimanya Sapanga jinhengila kike.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ndienu, Daudi jaaleka ahengo na anyongo atama na bambu nkolongu juku Moabu nabombi batama hoku kipindi soti Daudi sejabii jujobiki mu likolu.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Ndienu nndota Gadi ampwagila Daudi, “Wiitama pamba, boka mala jimu gujenda mu nndema wa Yuda.” Ndienu Daudi jaboka nukujenda ku kitengu sa Heleti gogubii ku Yuda.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Lisoba limu Sauli jabii ku Gibea, jatama pai ju nkongu gunkwaju pi kitombi, koni jubii nu nkoa waki mu kuboku na atumisi baki babiya ajemiki pulutengu jaki. Ndienu bumpwagila ana Daudi na bandu baki abonakini. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Najombi Sauli jaapwagila atumisi baki, “Henu mwanganya mwabandu bi likabila laka Benjamini nyoaninya, boo, nholale Daudi mwana waka Yese ampekiya kila jumu wii litui na matui gi mizabibu? Au boo nholale anhenga kila jumu wii jubia nkolongu jwa maelupu au nkolongu jwa alonda bake? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ndaba jakii mwanganya mwaboti nhenga mpangu gukung'anambuka? Ngakuba hata jumu winu jojumbwagi majambu ganga, kubanga mwana wangu jujetangani na mwana waka Yese. Kabee ndaba jaki ngakuba mundu hata jumu kati jinu jojumone ikia nukumbwagi kubanga Daudi jumu kati ja bandu bangu jutaputa napwasi jukungoma ngati ekubii lelenu?”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Ndienu Doegi mundu juku Edomu jojuwe jabiya jutei kujema pambipi na atumisi baka Sauli japwaaga, “Nummbona mwana waka Yese pajabiya juhikiki ku Nobu kwaka nngolu Ahimaleki mwana waka Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimaleki anndobila Daudi kwaka Bambu Sapanga, kabee ampekiya posu nu upanga waka Npilisti Goliati.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Bambu nkolongu Sauli jaatuma bandu kwaka nngolu Ahimaleki mwana waka Ahitubu bukunkema, pamu na bandu boti ba alongu ba atati baki babube babiya agolu ku Nobu. Boti bunzendila bambu nkolongu Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli japwaaga, “Ndienu gujoaninya wehapa wa mwana waka Ahitubu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Ahimaleki jajibua, “Hena bambu ndenda kugujoane.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli ampwagila, “Ndaba jakii wehapa na Daudi mwana waka Yese, nhengiki mpangu ukung'ambuka nenga ili kunngoma? Ndaba jakii gumpekiya mabumunda nu upanga, kabee nukunndobe kwaka Sapanga? Ndaba lelenu jutei kung'anambuka nu jutenda kunyobale.”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimaleki jajibua, “Kati ja atumisi baku, Daudi ndi kilongosi jojuhobaleka kupete boti. Jombi ndi nkoanu waku wehapa wa bambu nkolongu, nkolongu ju likundi la alonda baku babugulenda na antende isima kupeta boti panyumba jaku. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Lelenu nga mala ju utumbuli kunndoba Sapanga lijambu kwa ndaba jaki. Boo sajenu ndi nhengiki kihakau kunndoba Sapanga kwa ndaba jake? Ngahela hata kasopi. Bambu nkolongu wiindemu nepani wala mundu jokapi kati alongu bangu kupete hongu heji. Nepani nu ntumisi waku, ngasemanyiki sindu sokapi, sekiendale kupete lijambu heli.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Lakini bambu nkolongu Sauli ampwagila, “Ahimeleki, kye ngiti gutenda kuwa wehapa na bandu bu munyumba ja ahengo baku.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Sauli jaapwagila alonda babiya ajemiki pulutengu jaki, “Nng'anambuka na kwaakoma akaagolu baka Bambu Sapanga, ndaba bombi ajongana na Daudi, bamanyiki jwatiliki kwangu lakini ngasebambwagi.” Lakini alonda haba ngasebatondabiya maboku gabu ili kwaakoma agolu baka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Sauli ampwagila Doegi, “Wehapa ng'anambuka wakakoma agolu.” Doegi, mundu juku Edomu jajenda na kwaakoma agolu nhwanu boti. Lisoba heli Doegi jaakoma agolu semanini nu nhwanu babube awata izibau ikigolu ni ikitambaa kihuu. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Sauli jaakoma ku upanga bandu boti buku Nobu goguwe ndi musi wa agolu, akanalomi na akammbomba na bana asoku na bana baajonga na ng'ombi na maponda na makondoo.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Lakini Abiazali jumu ja bana baka Ahimeleki, mwana waka Ahitubu jakwelapuka jatilila kwaka Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiazali anndandila Daudi kubanga Sauli jaakomiki agolu baka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Najombi Daudi ampwagila Abiazali, “Lisoba alelale panummbona Doegi mundu juku Edomu namanyiki hotuhotu kubanga ngiti ampwagila bambu nkolongu Sauli. Ndienu, nepani ndi nenaahengiki bandu bu lukolu lwa atati baku akuwaje. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Wehapa tama pamba pamu nanepani, wala wiijogopa. Ndaba jojutaputa kungoma nepa ndi jojutaputa hata kugukoma wehapa. Ndienu ana gubii na nepani ngabagukome.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Daudi juokoo musi uku Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Ndienu Daudi ampwagila, “Joaninya, Apilisti akomana na bandu ba musi uku Keila na anyaga ilebi mwi ibanza yu kupete inganu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Ndienu, Daudi anndoba Bambu Sapanga malobi, “Boo, nyenda nakakomana na Apilisti hababa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Hena, jenda wakakomana na Apilisti na ukugukombola musi uku Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Lakini bandu baka Daudi bumpwagila, “Ana tubii pamba pa Yuda tutenda kujogopa ndaba Sauli juwesa kuhika kutulapula, kwibiya boo ana tupiti ku Keila na kukomana na alonda buku Pilisti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Ndienu, Daudi anndoba kabee Bambu Sapanga, najombi Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Jumuka gujenda ku Keila ndaba naagujangatiya waawesa Apilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Ndienu, Daudi jajenda ku Keila pamu na bandu baki, na koni jakomana na Apilisti bingi nu kukamuu ng'ombi hingi. Ndienu Daudi jaokua bandu buku Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abiazali, mwana waka Ahimaleki, pajatilila kwaka Daudi ku Keila, jajenda ni kizibau suku nngolu.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli pabumpwagila kubanga Daudi juhiki ku Kelila, japwaaga, “Sapanga anhengiki nunhwesa ndaba jilipungi mweni sukujingi mu musi gogubii nu lumatu na matanga gagabii na makomeu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ndienu, Sauli jaakema alonda buku Keila nu kukomana nabu, ili kumpengale Daudi pamu na bandu baki.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daudi pajajoa mipangu jiliya kupete jombi, ampwagila nngolu Abiazali, “Leta pamba kizibau saka nngolu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Ndienu Daudi jaloba, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, sakaka nepani ntumisi waku, nyoini ana Sauli jupanga kuhika musi uku Keila ndaba nepani mi pamba. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Boo, bandu buku Keila biimbelika kwake? Boo Sauli jitenda kuhelela, ngati ntumisi waku ejajoana? Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli mpwagila ntumisi waku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Najombi Bambu Sapanga japwaaga, “Sauli jiitenda kuhika.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi jalalukiya kabee, “Boo bandu buku Keila biitenda kungengale nepani pamu na bandu bangu kwaka Saule?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Najombi Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Biitenda kutukamula.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Ndienu Daudi na bandu baki babube babiya ngati mia sita, baboka nukujenda pokapi pabawesa kujenda. Sauli pajajoa ana Daudi jutili kuhuma ku Keila, jakotuka kujenda ku Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi mu nndema uku itombi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Ndienu, Daudi jahigaliya mu lukoba, mu nndema uku itombi yu mwiitengu ja musi uku Zifu. Sauli antaputa kila lisoba, lakini Sapanga anzangatiya Daudi kunhwesa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Daudi jamanya Sauli juhikiki ili kunkoma. Daudi jabiya jutama mu kitengu suku Zifu ku Holeshi. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonasani mwana waka Sauli ampwata Daudi ku Holeshi angangamalisa mwoju nu kupwaaga Sapanga jutenda kugulenda. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Yonasani ampwagila, “Wijogopa, atati bangu Sauli ngabagupati. Wehapa wibiya wa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, nepani niibiya ndenda kugujangati. Hata Sauli atati bangu jilimanyi lijambu heli.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Haba boti abeli, bahenga lilaganu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. Daudi jahigaliya ku musi uku Holeshi na Yonasani jajenda kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Sauli pajabiya jakona ku Gibea, bandu buku Zifu bunzendila kumpwagila, “Daudi jujoba mundema witu gogubii na ngomi ku Holeshi, ku itombi ya Hakila, yeibii upandi u kusini guku Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Henu, bambu nkolongu guhika ili gunhengila segukipa, ku upandi witu, lihengu litu libiya kumbeka Daudi mu ulongosi waku.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli jaajibua, “Mwanganya sakaka monee ikia, Bambu Sapanga jumpengaliya. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Nnzendaninya, nhakikisa kabee, mmanya pandu pajujoba, na nya joambweni pandu hapa, ndaba ambwagi kubanga jombi ndi nnzanza ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Nndingalakiya kila upandi mmanya pandu pajujobiki, ndienu nnetila majambu goa. Ndienu niijenda pamu na mwanganya ana jibiya jakona hoku, ndienu nepani nantaputa kati ja maelupu goti ga bandu bu nndema uku Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Ndienu, bakelubuka ku musi uku Zifu, bunndonguliya Sauli. Kipindi sehesi, Daudi na bandu baki babiya mu lukoba lwa Maoni, mu ligomba luku Alaba upandi uku kusini guku Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na bandu baki batumbuliya kuntaputa Daudi. Lakini Daudi paampwagila majambu haga, jajenda kujoba ku malibu, gagabii ku kitengu suku Maoni nu kutama hoku. Sauli pajajoa majambu ge haga jajenda kuntaputa Daudi ku kitengu suku Maoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli na bandu baki babiya upandi gumu guku itombi na Daudi na bandu baki babiya upandi gongi guku kitombi. Daudi pajabiya jutila, Sauli najombi jabiya junhegale kunkamuu Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Hapa ndi mundu jumu annzendila Sauli nu kumpwagi, “Nhika nnyata Apilisti baakoma bandu bu munndema.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ndienu, Sauli anndeka kumpwatali Daudi, jajenda kukomana na Apilisti. Ndii ndaba pandu jehapa bapakema, “Lilibu lukutila.” <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Daudi jaboka pandu hapa, jajenda kutama pandu pukujoba pi likolu la musi uku Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ammbone ikia Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sauli pajakelubuka kuhuma kukomana na Apilisti, bumpwagila ana Daudi jubii ku mbuga juku Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Ndienu, Sauli jaajukua alonda elupu itatu bajahangwi bababii nganganganga nakanopi kuhuma mu nndema gwoti guku Izilaeli, jajenda kuntaputa Daudi na bandu baki pandu pabapakema malibu ga holoku. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Sauli pajabiya jutenda kuboka, jahika ku likolu limu lelabii pambipi ni kisisi si likondoo, jajingala homu mu likolu ili kulijangati. Daudi na bandu baki babiya atemi nkati ngani ji likolu heli. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Bandu baka Daudi bapwaaga, “Lisoba lela lejugupwagila Bambu Sapanga kubanga jiihika ili kuguhenga gwaawesa abaja baku nawehapa wanhengila egwibona sapi, lelenu juhikiki.” Ndienu Daudi annzendila Sauli mbolimboli kuhuma mu nyuma, jasekula lupeta lwi ingobu jaki. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Daudi wabina mwoju waki ndaba jasekwi lupeta lwii ingobu jaka Sauli sanga mweni kumanya. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Jaapwagila bandu baki, “Bambu Sapanga jumbengaliya, niinhenga lihengu ngati heli kwaka bambu wangu joampaki mahuta na Bambu Sapanga. Niihenga lihengu ngati heli palongi jaka mundu jojuwe Bambu Sapanga annzakania mahuta ili jubiya bambu nkolongu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Kwa malobi haga, Daudi jaakolua bandu baki baanhenge liyaa Sauli. Jaakana bantenda sindu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:7">Ndienu Sauli jajema, nukupita mu likolu jaendaliya na sapwali jaki. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Mwenikatai, Daudi najombi jajumuka, japita mwi likolu nukunkema Sauli, “Bambu wangu, bambu nkolongu!” Bambu nkolongu Sauli pajalinga munyuma, Daudi japega magoti, nukujinama mbaka pai ili kutende isima Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Ndienu ampwagila, “Ndaba ja kii waajoanee bandu babugupwagi, ‘Linga! Daudi jupala kuguhenga liyaa?’” <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Henu linga lelenu gubweni kwa miu gaku wamweti, pawabii ku likolu Bambu Sapanga janyangatiya nuguwesa. Bandu bangi bambwagila nugukoma, lakini nenga nugubonila ikia. Napwaaga nganuguhumisi wa bambu wangu ndaba wehapa huhaguliwi na Bambu Sapanga sukugujakanii mahuta. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Mwaatati bangu, nndinga kipandi si ingobu jaku mu kuboku jangu, senzekwi mwiingobu jaku sanga kugukoma, guwesa henu kumanya ana sakaka kwa nepani nga nu mmbaja wala ngasenutende giliya. Nepani ngasenuguhengi kihakau lakini wehapa gundaputa gungoma. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Bambu Sapanga juamua kati jangu na wehapa. Jombi jugulepa kisasi lakini nepani nganuguhumisa. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Kombuka misali ja mwandi jejipwaaga, Kuhuma kwa bandu biliya gapita mahengu giliya. Lakini nepani nganuguhenge sindu sokapi siliya. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Wehapa wabambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli linga mundu jogupala kunkoma! Boo, ndaba jakii gumpwatali na mundu ngati nenga? Nepani mii pe ngati jimbwa jejikuike au lihonzu! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga nu jubiya mundu jukuamuu kati jangu na wehapa. Jombi ndi julilingaliya lijambu heli, jungengaliya nukunhoko kuhuma mu maboku gaku.<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daudi pajajomula kupwaaga, Sauli japwaaga, “Boo sakaka lee wa Daude?” Sauli jalela kwa sauti. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Ndienu ampwagila Daudi, “Wehapa guhenga gagapalika kupeta nepani, gunepi gaammboni, jenipe nepani nuguhengi giliya. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Lelenu gulangi namuna egubii waamboni kwangu. Ngasewangomiki hata ngati Bambu Sapanga janhenga gunhwesa. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Boo, ana mundu ankamwi mbaja waki juwesa kundeka jujenda sape? Kwa legunhengi, Bambu Sapanga jugupengaliya lelenu! <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Ndienu, manyiki kubanga sakaka wibiya wa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli nu ubambu ukolongu waku wiitenda kugangamaliswa pai ju ulongosi waku. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Lakini gunapila kwaka Bambu Sapanga, kubanga ngawailapu ibeleku yangu, wala kwaputa liina langu kuhuma mu ulongu wa atati bangu.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daudi anndapila Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:22">Ndienu Sauli jakelubuka panyumba jaki lakini Daudi na bandu baki bajenda pandu paajoba.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Ndienu, Samweli jutenda kuwa, nabombi Aizilaeli boti bakusanyika ili kwalobalake. Buntaga panyumba jaki ku Lama.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Daudi na Abigaeli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Egapeta haga Daudi jajenda mu lukoba luku Palami. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Kwabii na mundu jumu ku musi uku Maoni jojabiya julomba nukulombesa hindu pambipi na musi uku Kalumeli. Japuga makondoo gaki na kwagaseku mangoma. Jabiya mundu jojubii na mali gingi ngamaa, jabiya na makondoo elupu itatu ni imbui elupu jimu. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Mundu hoju ankema Nabali nu nhwanamundu ankemika Abigaili. Abigaili jabii mmbomba jojubii na malangu na jojunyambiki. Lakini Nabali jabiya mundu jojusuki na jojubii ni inyela kabee jabiya ju lukolu lwaka Kalebu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:3">Nabali jabiya juseku mangoma ga makondoo ku Kalumeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />na Daudi pajabii ku lukoba jajoana Nabali jabii jugaseku makondoo mangoma ku Kalumeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Ndienu jaatuma akakombu komi, jaapwagila, “Nnzendaninya kwaka Nabali ku Kalumeli mukumpwagila malobi gango. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Mukumpwagila ana Daudi jutenda kugulamuki ana, ‘Lukwali lubiya kwaku, ni kilongu saku na goti gagubi naku. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Nyoini kubanga ugaseku mangoma makondoo gaku mbala gumanya kubanga alimi baku pababii pamu na twepani, natwepani ngasetwatei sindu siliya. Kabe kipindi soti pababii pamu na twepani ku musi uku Kalimeli, ngasebaajibii sindu sokapi. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Ana waalaluki bagupwagila akakombu bangu haba ajetakaliwi palongi jaku, ndaba tuhikiki kipindi sa matola. Gupepa koku waapekiya sokapi segubii naku atumisi baku haba nanepani mwana waku Daudi.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Akombu baka Daudi bala bajenda kumpwagi Nabali ngati ejaalagalakiya Daudi. Ndienu balendaliya lijibu laka Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Ndipala Nabali jaajibua atumisi baka Daudi, “Daudi ndi nyanye? Mwana waka Yese ndi nyane? Masoba gani abii atumisi bingi babaatila aka bambu babu. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Boo, nyukua mabumunda gangu, masi gangu ni inyama jenaasinzi baaseku mangoma ga makondoo gangu kwaapeke bandu baahiki pamba ngasemanyiki koahuma?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Ndienu akakombu baka Daudi bakelubuka nukumpwagi Daudi ejaajibua Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Ndienu, Daudi jaapwagila bandu baki, “Kila mundu jukonga upanga waki mukibunu.” Kila mundu jakonga upanga waki, na Daudi jakonga upanga waki, bandu mia nsesi bumpwata Daudi na bandu mia ibeli bahigaliya ni misigu.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Nkombu jumu jwaka Nabali ampwagila Abigaili nhwanu waka Nabali, “Daudi jaatuma bandu kuhuma ku lungwenza ili kunndamuki bambu witu. Lakini jombi jatenda kwaatondo.” <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Lakini bandu haba babiya baamboni ngamaa kwitu, ngasebutuhumise ni kipindi soti patwaabii naku ku lungwenza ngasebutujibi sokapi. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Butulenda ikilu na muhi kipindi soti setwabii kwabu tulima makondoo. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Henu guholaliya sapi lijambu heli liwesa kuleta ngondu kwaka bambu witu na bandu bu munyumba jaki. Jombi Nabali ndi mundu juliya na ngakuba jojuwesa kulonge naku.<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaili jahenga nnyata, jajukua mabumunda mia ibeli ni mipuku mibeli ya ngosi yeitweli divai ni inyama ja makondoo nhwanu jeateliki sapi na kilu saba yi ilombi ikalangi ni ingonyu mia jimu ya zabibu ijomu ni mabumunda ga tini mia ibeli na hindu yoti jiikwea mu maponda. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Jaapwagila atumisi baki bala, “Longuliya! Nepani ngiti nukujengaliya.” Lakini ngaseampwagi nndomi waki.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Pajabiya jukwei liponda laki nu juhele pi ligomba li kitombi apalapa jaketangana na Daudi jakahika koni jubii na bandu baki atenda kunhiki upandi waki. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daudi jabiya juholale, “Ndaba jaki nabiya nonda mali goka gaka Nabali ku lukoba sanga kupata sindu sokapi na nga sindu saki sokapi sekihobiki, najombi junepiki mabaja kwa gaamboni ganunhengi. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Sapanga ndi jungoma nepani. Ana kilabu pulukela niibiya ngasenaakomiki akanalomi baki boti.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigaili paambona pee Daudi, jahelala mala jimu kuhuma kunani ji liponda laki japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai palongi jaka Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Jililekala pa magolu nu kumpwagi Daudi, “Bambu wangu makosa goti gabiya gangu nepani. Gupepa koku nuguloba nongila nawehapa nepani ntumisi waku. Nuguloba gunyoaninya malobi gaka ntumisi waku. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Wanholale Nabali, jombi ndi mundu jwiliya ndaba elibii liina laki Nabali, ndi najombi ejubi. Jombi ankema Nabali na sakaka ndi mundu nng'ang'a. Bambu wangu akakombu bala pawaatuma, nepani ntumisi waku ngasenaabweni. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Ndienu Bambu wangu, napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi na egubii wa mwomi, kubanga ndaba Bambu Sapanga jugupengalii wiilepesa kisasi sakwakoma nu kupata lawama, waaleka abaja baku na bandu boti babuguholale majambu giliya abiya ang'ang'a ngati Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Bambu wangu, nuguloba gujopa nhupi jenze jenuguleti, na waapekiya bandu baku babugupwatiki. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Nuguloba gunekakiya nepani ntumisi waku. Bambu Sapanga jagupekiya akakilongu baabii nganganganga ndaba wehapa wa bambu wangu, gukomana ngondu yaka Bambu Sapanga. Kipindi soti sukutama kwaku gagupata majambu gokapi giliya. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Ana kupiti bandu bugupwatalii nu kupala kugukoma, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, jakulamisa kutama kwaku pamu na baabii bomi. Lakini kutama kwa abaja baku kwihobila kutali, ngati mundu ejuleke lilibu kwa kombeu. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Bambu Sapanga hejiibia juguhengi gaamboni goti gajugulagi, na kuguhagu kuba bambu nkolongu juku jwa Aizilaeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />wehapa bambu wangu, ngawiikubi na sababu jukuligana wala kutemuliwa na mwoju kulengana nu kukoma sanga sababu sukulepa kisasi. Lakini bambu wangu, Bambu Sapanga pajiibiya juguhengi gaamboni, nuguloba gungombuka nepani ntumisi waku.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daudi ampwagila Abigaili, “Julumbalika Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, jojugutumiki lelenu kuketangana na nepani. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Nndumbaliya Bambu Sapanga jojugupeki isima yukumpengale nepani kuba na makosa gukukoma nukulepesa kisasi nepani namweti. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Sakaka, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, jumbengali ili na guhumisa wehapa. Lakini napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga juku Izalaeli jojubii mwomi ndaba ana nga wakahengiki nnyata kuhika kuketangana na nepani, sakaka kilabu pulukela nga mwanalomi jokapi jwaka Nabali jojakahigaliyaje kuba mwomi.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Ndienu, Daudi jajopa hindu yoti yeyuye Abigaili jabiya andeti, ampwagila Abigaili, “Kelubuka kunyumba jaku su lukwali. Linga nepani nagajoini gawapwaga, nu kuloba kwaku nukujopiki.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigaili pajakelubuka kunyumba, anketaninya Nabali juhenga tipati ngolongu panyumba jaki ngati bambu nkolongu. Nabali jabiya jutogule ngamaa mu mwoju jaki ndaba jabiya julobii ngamaa. Ndienu ngaseampwagila sokapi mbaka pulukela. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Pulukela Abigaili pajalinga nndomi waki kulobe kwaki kuhengwiki mu mutu, anndandila majambu goa, apalapa Nabali jatenda kutenguka, jabiya ngati lilibu.<verse eid="1SA 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Lisoba la komi mwenikatai, Bambu Sapanga anndapula Nabali jatenda kuwa.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daudi pajajoa Nabali jutei kuwa japwaga, “Julumbalika Bambu Sapanga joandepiki kisasi Nabali sukundondo, najombi Bambu Sapanga junyepisi nepani ntumisi waki kuhenga makosa. Bambu Sapanga andepiki Nabali ku ubaja waki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Ndienu Daudi jaatuma bandu ili bukunsumbila Abigaili jubiya nhwanamundu. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Atumisi baka Daudi pabahika kwaka Abigaili ku Kalimeli, bumpwagila, “Daudi jututumiki kugujuku wakabiya gu nhanu waki.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaili jajumuka nukupega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai palongi jabu kupwaga, “Nepani ndi ntumisi pena, mii tayali kugolo magolu ga atumisi baka bambu wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaili jahenga nnyata jajumuka nu kukwela panani ji liponda laki. Jaboka nu kupwatana na atumisi baki akammbomba nhwanu, jajenda na atumisi baka Daudi, najombi jabiya nhwanu waka Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Kabee Daudi anzukua Ahinoamu kuhuma ku musi uku Yezieli. Ndienu boti abeli haba babiya akaahanu baki. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Kipindi se hesi, Sauli ampia Mikali kamwali waki jojuwe jabiya nhwanu waka Daudi, ili anzukua Paliti mwana waka Laishi, kuhuma musi wa Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ambone kabee ikia Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Akanalomi bangi kuhuma ku musi uku Zifu bunzendila Sauli ku Gibea bumpwagila ana Daudi jujobiki ku kitombi suku Hakila, upandi golipiti lyoba uku Heshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Apalapa Sauli jajenda ku lukoba la Zifu kuntaputa Daudi, jabiya julongini na akalonda baabi nganganganga elupu itatu babahaguliwi kuhuma ku Izalaeli. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sauli jagonila kabee panani ji kitombi suku Hakila, pambipi ni indela ju upandi golipiti lyoba uku Heshimoni. Lakini Daudi jabiya jakona ku lukoba. Daudi pajamanya kubanga Sauli jabiya juhikiki ku lukoba kuntaputa, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />jaatuma bandu baalaluki, nabombi bummanyisa kubanga ndi sakaka. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Daudi japita, jajenda pandu pajabiya Sauli jugonii. Pajupabona pandu pajugoni Sauli na Abineli mwana waka Neli, jojuwe jabia kilongosi wamakundi ga alonda baka Sauli, jabiya jugoni pambipi na Sauli. Sauli jabiya jugonii pikilanda ja mahema gagayongalitwi na alonda baki.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Daudi jaapwagila Ahimeleki mundu juku Hiti na Abishani nndongu waka Yoabu, “Nya jojijenda pamu nanepani mu likambi laka Sauli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishai anzibua, “Nepani niijenda pamu wehapa.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Ndienu ikilu, Daudi na Abishai bajingala mu likambi laka Sauli. Bunketaninya Sauli jugonii pikilanda ji likambi heli, nu nkoa waki juhomiki mu nndema pambipi ni kimutu saki. Abineli pamu na alonda babaii agonii kunyongolota Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai ampwagila Daudi, “Lelenu Sapanga jugujangati guunhwesa Sauli. Ndienu neka nunhosa nkoa mala jimu pena, nganuhosi mala pabeli.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Lakini Daudi ampwagila Abishai, “Waankoma ndaba sakaka Bambu Sapanga anndapula mundu jokapi jojandapula nu kuhumisa mundu joanhagwi sukumpaki mahuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, kubanga Bambu Sapanga mweni ndi joankoma Sauli, au lisoba la kuwa lihika au jwiijenda kukukomana ngondu nukuwele hoku. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga jangana naandapu wala kuunhumisa mundu joanhagwi sukunnzakanii mahuta. Lakini jukua nkoa waki gogubii pambipi ni kimutu saki pamu ni liboto laki la masi tujendaniya.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ndienu, Daudi jajukua nkoa ni liboto la masi lelabii pambipi ni kimutu saka Sauli. Lakini nga mudnu jojabona au kumanya lijambu heli, nabombi wala ngajojujumwiki, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jaaletila lugonu lwingi.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Ndienu Daudi jajenda upandi wa pili u ligomba heli, jajema panani ji kitombi kutali ni likundi laka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Daudi jaakema alonda bi likundi laka Sauli na Abineli mwana waka Neli, japwaaga, “Abineli boo, gunyoana lena?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abineli jajalukiya, “Wa nyane wegunkemiki bambu nkolongu?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi jajibua, “Boo, wehapa nga le wa mwanalome? Nya jojulengini na wehapa mu Izilaeli? Mbona ngasegunndendiki bambu nkolongo wako? Mundu jumu jajingala hoku nukupala kunkoma bambu nkolongu waku! <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Gusindwiki kuhenga lihengu laku sapi. Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, kubanga jupalika kuwa, ndaba ngasegundonda bambu waku, jojuwe Bambu Sapanga annzakani mahuta. Ndienu gulinga nkoa waka bambu nkolongu ni liboto la masi lela lelabii pambipi ni kimutu saki ana ibii!”<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sauli jijimanyiki sauti jaka Daudi anndalukiya, “Boo heji ndi sauti mwana Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Daudi anzibua, “Bambu wangu, bambu nkolongu ndi sauti jangu.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Ndienu jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Lakini ndaba jakii, wehapa wa bambu wangu gumbwataliya nepani nu ntumisi wako? Boo, nhengiki kike? Boo, nhengiki likosa bole? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Ndienu, bambu wangu nkolongu gujoania malobi guku ntumisi waku. Ana kubii Bambu Sapanga ndi jojugukoluke guhika kwangu nepani, ndienu jujopa matambiku gaganhenga jung'anambula mawasu gaki. Lakini ngati ndi bandu, ndienu Bambu Sapanga jaalapila bandu haba ndaba amengiki mu nndema gojutupeki Bambu Sapanga gubiya witu, kupwaaga, ‘Jenda ukuitumakiya isapanga yengi.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Wineka ngua mu nndema ukigeni, kutali na Bambu Sapanga. Ndaba wehapa wa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli guhuma kugutaputa womi wangu. Ngati mundu jojubenga ngwali mwiitombi.”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Ndienu Sauli jajibua, “Nepani nhengiki Kihakau. Kelubuka mwanangu Daudi. Nganaguhumisi kabete ndaba gunei sanga kungoma lelenu. Nepani nu ng'ang'a na ngosii ngamaa.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi jajibua, “Waa bambu, nkoa waku gubii pamba, ntuma nkombu waku jumu juhika kujuku. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Bambu Sapanga antunza kila mundu kwa uamboni nu kuhobaleka kwaki. Lelenu Bambu Sapanga junyangati nuguwesa, lakini nepani ngasenugulapwi wala kuguhumisa wehapa ndaba wehapa Bambu Sapanga jugujakanii mahuta ili gubiya wabambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Linga ngati lelenu eahamwi kuguleka sanga kugukoma, ahelahe nunndoba Bambu Sapanga jumokia mang'aliku goti mu kutama kwangu kwoti.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Sauli ampwagila Daudi, “Sapanga jugupengaliya wa mwanawa Daudi. Wiihenga majambu makolongu, na majambu gaku goti gagujendila sapi.” Ndienu Daudi jatenda kuboka, Sauli najombi jabuja kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Daudi jutama kwa Apilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Daudi jilipwagila mmwoju jaki, “Lisoba limu, Sauli jiitenda kungoma. Lijambu laamboni kwangu ndi kutili ku nndema wa Apilisti. Sauli jikotuka kunndaputa nkati ji mipaka ju nndema guku Izilaeli, nanepani niibiya na mwomi.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Ndienu, apalapa Daudi na bandu baki mia sita bajenda ku Akishi mwana waka Maoki bambu nkolongu juku Gati. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi na bandu baki, pamu na alongu baki batama na Akishi ku Gati. Daudi jabiya na akaambomba abeli, Ahinoamu kuhuma ku Yezeleeli na Abigaili mbomba jojuwelii na alomi kuhuma ku musi uku Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli pajajoa kubanga Daudi jutili ku Gati ngaseampwata kabete.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Lisoba limu Daudi ampwagila Akishi, “Ana gunyetakali nuguloba gumbekiya musi gumu munndema waku ili gubiya pandu pangu pukutama. Ndaba jaki ntumisi waku kutama na wehapa mu musi gongo gu ubambu nkolongu.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Lisoba heli, Akishi ampekiya musi uku Sikilagi. Ndienu tumbuka lisoba heli musi uku Sikilagi wabiya mali gaka bambu nkolongu juku Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Daudi jatama mu nndema wa Apilisti kwa saka simu na mie nsesi.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Mu kipindi se hesi, Daudi na bandu baki baalapula Ageshuli na Agilizi na Aamaleki, babube babii benei bu nndema hogu tumbuka pa mwandi. Jaalapula munndema wabu mbaka ku Shuli, mu mpaka uku Misili. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Daudi jaalapula bandu bu nndema hogu na ngaseandei mundu mwomi jokapi, jubiya mwanalomi au mmbomba, jagakamula makondoo na maponda na ngamia ni ingobu, ndienu jakelubuka nu kuhika ku Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Akishi kila ejabiya anndaluki, “Lelenu ukakomana na nyanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 27:10">Daudi anzibua, “Bandu bu upandi gu kusini juku Yuda, au upandi gu kusini ju nndema ja Ayelameeli au upandi gu kusini ja Akeni.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daudi ngaseandei mundu jokapi mwomi jukubi mwanalomi au mmbomba ili juletwa ku Gati, jaholaliya mwoju jaki, “Awesa kulandi kupete twepani nu kupwaaga, ‘Daudi jahenga lihengu heli na ale.’” Ndienu Daudi ejayobali kuhenga kipindi soti pajatemi munndema wa Apilisti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Lakini, Akishi anhobaliya Daudi, koni juholale, “Ndienu jindumakiya nepani mu kutama kwaki kwoti.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Ku kipindi sengi, Apilisti bakusanya alonda babu tayali kujenda kukomana na Aizilaeli. Akishi ampwagila Daudi, “Guelawa sapi kubanga wehapa na bandu baku mpalika kujongana pamu nanepani kujenda kukomana ngondu.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daudi anzibua Akishi, “Hena! Wakibona sindu sesuse juwesa kuhenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akishi ampwagila, “Nanepani naguhenga kuba nndonda wangu jukunenda masoba goti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli jujenda kwaka mundu jojulondoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Kipindi sehesi Samweli jabiya jukuwiki nabombi Aizilaeli boti buntaga nukuendale kunndele ku nyumba jaki ku Lama. Sauli jabiya jaabengiki bababii ni ilombu yukulondoo na ahabi.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Apilisti bakusanyika nu kubeka likambi labu ku Shunemu, na Sauli jaakusanya Aizilaeli boti nu kubeka kambi jabu ku kitombi suku Giliboa.<verse eid="1SA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sauli pajaabona alonda ba Apilisti jatumbuliya kujogopa ngani, nukubagaja ku lujogopu lojabii naku mmwoju jaki. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Ndienu andoba Bambu Sapanga lijambu, Bambu Sapanga ngaseanzibua kwa ndotu wala kwa malibu gu ulimu wala kwi indela ja alota. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Ndienu, Sauli jaapwagila atumisi baki, “Ndaputiya mmbomba jojubii ni ilombu yu kulondoo ili nunzendila, nhwesa kulaluki kwaki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Atumisi baki bumpwagila, “Jubii mmbomba jumu ku Endoli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ndienu, Sauli jahula ingobu yaki ikibambu nu kuwata ingobu yengi ili bandu bammanya, na ekwahika ikilu jajenda na bandu abeli kwaka mmbomba hoju. Ampwagila, “Gunonduliya kwi ilombu nu gunetila pundema mundu jokapi jonaguloguliya liina laki.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Mmbomba hoju ampwagila, “Wehapa gumanyiki sejuhengiki bambu nkolongu Sauli. Jaakomiki baalondoo na ahabi boti mu nndema uku Izilaeli. Boo, ndaba jakii gumbendaki kitaba ili nguwaje?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sauli jalapa kwi liina laka Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Sakaka ana Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, kubanga ngakuba malapuli gokapi gagagupata kulengana ni lijambu heli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Ndipala, mmbomba jola jalalukiya, “Boo, gupala nuguletila nyane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Sauli japwaaga, “Netila Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Mmbomba jola paammbona Samweli, jajamaliya kwa sauti ngolongu najombi anndalukiya Sauli, “Boo, mbona gutei kungonga? Wehapa ndi wa Sauli!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Wijogopa! Gukibona kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Mmbomba jaapwaga, “Nikibona kisapanga kikwela kuhuma pai ju nndema.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Najombi anndalukiya, “Ndi julengana na kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Mmbomba jupwaaga, “Julengana na mwanalomi nseja juwati ingobu nasu jutenda kukwela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ndipala Sauli jamanya ndi Samweli. Sauli japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pu luombi.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samweli anndalukiya Sauli, “Ndaba jakii gung'alisa sukungwea kunane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Sauli ampwagila, “Nepani nzumbuka ngamaa, ndaba Apilisti akomana ngondu na nepani, najombi Sapanga jutei kuneka. Ngasejunyibu kabee wala kwi indela ja alota wala kwa ndotu. Ndienu nugukemiki wehapa ili gumbwagila sukuhenga.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samweli japwaaga, “Ndaba jakii gunaluki nepani, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jugulei na kuba umbaja wake? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Bambu Sapanga juguhengi sejambwagila nugupwagila. Bambu Sapanga juguboiki ubambu nkolongu kuhuma kwaku, na ampeki Daudi Nzilaeli nnzaku. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Ndaba wehapa ngasegunnzetaki Bambu Sapanga, wala ngasewanhengiki sejugutuma Bambu Sapanga kwaahenge Aamaleki ndi ndaba lelenu juguhenge majambu haga. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Kabee Bambu Sapanga jaajangatiya Apilisti aguwesa wehapa na bandu baku. Kilabu wehapa na bana baku mwiibiya pamu nanepani, hata alonda ba Izilaeli Bambu Sapanga jahenga Apilisti buguwesa.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Apalapa Sauli lunkamula lujogopu lukolongu nu kuhabuka nu lutumbu ndaba ja malobi gaka Samweli gala, kwa ndaba ngasejabii na makili gokapi, ndaba ngasejakuliki kilebi pipipipi na kelukelu. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Mmbomba jola anzendila Sauli nu kummbona jupatiki lujogopu, ampwagila, “Linga nepani nu ntumisi waku nakabiya nguwiki lelenu kukuhenga segunagalaki nhenga. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Ndienu, nuguloba gujoannya nuntumisi waku, gunyetakaliya nugutelakiya posu gukula ili gubiya na makili nu guendaliya na sapwali jaku.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Jakana nukupwaaga, “Nepani ngasembai kula.” Lakini atumisi baki bajongana nu mmbomba jola nu kumpembalake jukula najombi jatenda kujetake. Ndienu Jajumuka pai hapa, jatama panani ji kitanda. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Mmbomba jola jabiya na katoli kakakendiki panyumba jaki, jasinza apalapa. Jajukua uwembi jakanda jajosa libumunda langa kujege amila. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Anhandaliya posu Sauli na kabee atumisi baki, nabombi batenda kula. Ndienu babokaninya ikilu jeje.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Apilisti bunkana Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Ndienu Apilisti bakusanya alonda babu boti ku Afeka na Aizilaeli batama ku kiliba si ligomba luku Yezileeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Akolongu nhwanu buku Pilisti pababiya apeta ni ikundi yabu ya bandu mia na elupu, Daudi pamu na bandu baki pamu na Akishi babiya apwata upandi gu munyuma gwa alonda haba. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Alonda ba Apilisti balalukiya, “Aebulania haba ahenga ki apapa?” Akishi jajibua alonda haba ba Apilisti, “Ajo ndi Daudi, ntumisi waka Sauli bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, najombi jubii na nepani kwa masoba gingi, yaka isokopi tumbuka ejatilila kwangu ngasenilibweni likosa lokapi.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Lakini alonda buku Pilisti bunyomi ngamaa Akishi, bumpwagila, “Nkelubua jujenda pandu pabumpeki jutama. Ngasekupalika kujenda na twepani ku ngondu anangahela kipindi sukukomana jiing'anambuka nukutumbuli kwaakoma alonda bitu. Sukuhenga hela ngasegubona kubanga mundu hoju jwiipata indela ja sapi jukulengana na bambu waki kabete? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Boo, Hajo lee nga Daudi jojuwe akammbomba bajemba majambu gaki pababiya ahina bakapwaga, ‘Sauli jukomiki bandu elupu, lakini Daudi jukomiki makome elupu.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Ndienu Akishi ankema Daudi nukumpwagi, “Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga ngati ejutama, wehapa gubii wa mundu woguhobaleka, nanepani napala guhenga lihengu pamu nanepani. Tumbuka lisoba lewahika kwangu lela mbaka sajenu, ngasenilibweni likosa lokapi kwaku, hata hela akolongu haba ngasebalisiki na wehapa. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Ndeinu gubuja kunyumba. Gujenda ku lukwali ili wasukisa akolongu ba Apilisti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daudi andalukiya Akishi, “Lakini nepani ndei kike? Boo, gukibweni kii sindu siliya tumbuka lisoba lenahika kwaku mbaka leleno? Ndaba jakii niijenda nukukomana na abaja baka bambu nkolongu wango?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi anzibua Daudi, “Nepani manyiki kubanga wehapa gubii wogulenganii pamihu jangu ngati atumi baka Sapanga. Lakini alonda ba Apilisti apwaaga, ‘Hoju ngasegundengane kujenda ngondu pamu na twepani.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Ndienu, jumuka kanyata, pamu na atumisi babundekiki bambu waku baalongini nawehapa, kilabu pulukela mmbokania.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ndienu, Daudi na bandu baki bajumuka pulukela nakanopi, bajenda kukelabuka mu nndema uku Pilisti, nabombi Apilisti bakwela kujenda ku Yezileeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Daudi jukomana na Aamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Egapeta masoba matatu Daudi na bandu baki babuja ku Sikilagi. Aamaleki babiya bijisambulia nukujijosa mwotu misi juku Negebu nuku Sikilagi. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Nabombi babiya baajukwi akammbomba pamu na bandu boti babaii homu, akakombu na aseja. Ngasebunkomiki jokapi, baajukua koni abii bomi nukujendane. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daudi na bandu baki pabahika ku musi uku Sikilagi, buguketanya musi bugutinii kwa mwotu na bandu Aamaleki na akahanu babu pamu na bandu babu na akakamwali babu atei kwaakamu. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Ndienu, Daudi na bandu baki bapega keleli mbaka gaajomuka makili ngani gukulela.<verse eid="1SA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Aakahanu abeli baka Daudi babiya baakamwi yani Ahinomu juku Yezileeli na Abigaili, mmbomba joawii alomi waka Nabali juku Kalimeli nabombi batenda kwa kamu.<verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Ndienu Daudi jabiya na mang'aliku makolongu ndaba bandu baki babi nu usungu mu mioju jabu sukwaahoa bana babu, ndienu bunnzogua kundapu malibu. Lakini Daudi julipekia mwoju sukunhobale Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waki. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Ndipala, Daudi ampwagila Abiazali, mwana waka Ahimeleki, “Netila kizibau suku nngolu.” Abiazali jatenda kunndete, <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />najombi Daudi anndalukiya Bambu Sapanga, “Boo nilipwata likundi hale lelijenda kutukalila? Boo, mbaka naapate?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Bambu Sapanga jajibua, “Waapwataje sakaka mbaka guwesi kwaaohokoa.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Daudi jaboka pamu na bandu baki mia sita pabahika ku ligomba luku Besoli, alonda bangi baka Daudi bahigali papu. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Lakini Daudi pamu na bandu mia nsesi baendaliya kwaapwata. Ndaba bandu mia ibeli babiya asokiki ngamaa na ngasebawesa kulomboka ligomba heli. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Alonda bala babiya na Daudi bunketaninya mundu jumu juku Misili kulugwenza, nabombi bumpelika kwaka Daudi. Bumpekia mundu hoju mabumunda na masi. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Kabee bumpekiya ipandi ya mabumunda ga tini ni ingonyu ibeli i mizabibu nyomu. Pajajomula kula japata makili, ndaba jabiya ngasejukuliki wala kunywa sindu sokapi kwa masoba matatu muhi ni ikilu. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daudi anndalukiya, “Wehapa ndi wa nyane nu guhumiki kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Jajibua, “Nepani na mundu juku Misili ntumwa jwa Aamaleki. Bambu wangu jatei kuneka panalwai masoba matatu gagapetiki. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Tugulapula nndema uku Negebu gwa Akeleti nu nndema wa Yuda na Negebu ju lukolu lwaka Kalebu. Natwepani tugujosa mwotu musi Sikilagi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi jalalukiya, “Boo, guwesa kunongosa kulihiki likundi la bandu baatukalila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Jajibua, “Ana gunapi palongi jaka Sapanga kubanga ngawiingomi wala kungabisa mu maboku gaka bambu hoju, nanepani nagupelika mbaka koabii.” <verse eid="1SA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Andongua Daudi mbaka pandu pajabii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:16">Nabombi babiya apesangini mu lieneu loti, bakula na kunywa nukuhenga tipati ndaba jukukamu hindu kuhuma ku nndema uku Apilisti nu kuhuma ku Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daudi jakomana nabombi bakomana kutumbu pulukela mbaka pikilabu jaki pakamii. Nga mwanalomi jokapi jojalama ila akakombu mia nsesi babiya akwei ngamia nu kutila. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daudi jakelubua kila sindu Aamaleki sebabii ajukwi, pamu na akahanu baki abeli. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Nga sokapi sekihobiki, jukubi nkombu au nseja na mwanalomi au kamwali, hindu yoti yebabiya akamwi Daudi jatenda kuikelabu. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Jajukua makundi goti ga makondoo, imbui na ng'ombi na bandu baki biilima inyama hei palongi ji inyama yengi yukupugwa bapwaaga, “Haye ndi inyama yejinyagiki Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Ndienu Daudi jakelubukia bandu mia ibeli bala babube baaleka kuligomba la Besoli ndaba babiya asokiki ngamaa kumpwata. Bandu pabummbona Daudi pamu na bababii pamu najombi, bajenda kunnzopa. Daudi pajahika pambipi na bandu haba jaalamukiya sukutogule. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Lakini bandu boti abaja na bini milomu kati ja apwasi ba bandu babalongini na Daudi bapwaaga, “Ndaba ngasebapiti pamu na twepani, ngatubagani nabu hindu yetwanyagiki. Lakini kila mundu juwesa kunzukua nhwanamundu na bana baki nukuboka.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daudi ampwagila, “Ngahela alongu bangu. Nganhwesi kuhenga hela kwa sindu sejugupeki Bambu Sapanga, jutulendiki sapi, nu kujangati twaawesa alonda babahikiki kutulapula. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Nga mundu jojujetangana na mawasu ginu! Jojapiti mukukomana na jojahigali ni misigu jitu, kila mundu jiipata pandu papalengana nu nzaki.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Tumbuka lisoba heli Daudi jahenga uamusi hogu kuba malagalaki na kanuni munndema uku Izilaeli mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daudi pajakelubuka ku Sikilagi, jaapelakiya akakosi baki, babube ndi aseja buku Yuda hindu yejakamwi kupwaaga, “Naapelake nhupi kuhuma kwa abaja baka Bambu Sapanga.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Jatuma nhupi heji kwa aseja bababii ku Beseli Lamoti Negebu na Yatili, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />bandu babii ku Aloeli nu ku Sifimoti nuku Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />na Lakali na bandu babaii mu lukolu lwa Ayelameeli na akakilongosi ba Akeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />na akakilongosi ba musi uku Holuma nuku Boli Ashani nuku Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na bandu buku Helumoni na kwa bandu bababii pandu pangi poti papuje Daudi na bandu baki bababia ajenda kujoba.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Sauli na bana baki atenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1Majambu gi Ipindi 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Ndienu, Apilisti bakomana ngondu na Aizilaeli. Aizilaeli batila palongi ja Apilisti na bangi baakoma mu kitombi suku Giliboa, bandu bangi buku Izilaeli pamu na bambu nkolongu Sauli na bana baki batenda kutila. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Apilisti ambenga Sauli na bana baki na kwaakoma, Yonasani na Abinadamu na Maliki Shua. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Ngondu jabiya ngolongu ngamaa pandu pajabii Sauli. Nabombi baahoma misali pabumbona bunndapula nukunhumisa ngamaa. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Sauli ampwagila mundu jojutoto hindu yukukomane, “Jukua upanga waku gunhosa ngua, ili bandu haba banga kuseku jandu binhosa upanga nukunongama.” Lakini joantotuli hindu yukukomane ngasejalenga ndaba jajogopi ngamaa. Ndienu Sauli jahopula upanga waki mweni nukuguhabuki. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Jojutoto hindu yukukomane jola pajabona Sauli jukuwiki, kabee jahabukiya pu upanga waki, najombi jakuwa pamu na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Ndienu Sauli jakuwa, na bana baki atatu na jojutoto hindu yukukomane na alonda baki boti bakuwa pamu lisoba alelale. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Nabombi Aizilaeli bababii upandi wa pili uligomba, na bangi babaii upandi golipiti lyoba wa losi lwa Yoludani pababona kubanga Aizilaeli atei kutila, najombi Sauli na bana baki atei kuwa, bahama misi jabu nukutila. Apilisti bajenda nukutama mu misi heji.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Kilabu jaki Apilisti pabajenda kujuku hindu ya bandu babakomiki bijikolila mitui jaka Sauli na bana baki atatu ku kitombi suku Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Bunsekula Sauli kimutu nu kunhula hindu yaki yukukomane, nabombi baatuma bandu mu nndema goti wa Apilisti kulandi majambu mu nyumba ji imong'umong'u kati ja bandu babu. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Babeka hindu yabu yukokomane mu nyumba jaka kisapanga sa mmbomba sebikikema Maashitaloti nu kukonga yega jaki mu ukuta wa musi uku Beti Shani.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Bandu buku Yabeshi Gileadi pabajoa majambu ga Apilisti ebunhengi Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />alonda boti baboka, bajenda kelukelu, baboa yega jaka Sauli na yega ja bana baki kuhuma ku lumatu luku Beti Shani, bahika naku mbaka ku Yabeshi nukutini kwa mwotu. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Ndienu, bajukua mahupa gabu nukujitaga pai ju nkongu gu mkwaju ku Yabeshi, nabombi bapunga kula posu masoba saba.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>